window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/courses/a458-585ffab72eabed99.json"]={sha256:"585ffab72eabed999ed4c2f0850df70be9b100d74571687c41960c6c0948ff1d",value:{"id":"a458","title":"粒子加速器射頻腔","titleEn":"Particle-accelerator radio-frequency cavities","category":"instruments","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"以 500 MHz 級常溫銅射頻腔為主軸，從 TM010 模態與渡越時間因子推到銅壁損耗、分路阻抗與冷卻，再把輸入耦合器 β、網路分析儀與珠拉量測、熱失諧調諧、束流負載補償及速調管與低階射頻迴路整合成可交接的加速腔工程紀錄。","summaryEn":"Built around a 500 MHz-class normal-conducting copper cavity, the course goes from the TM010 mode and transit-time factor to copper wall loss, shunt impedance and cooling, then integrates the input-coupler β, network-analyser and bead-pull measurements, thermal-detuning tuning, beam-loading compensation and the klystron plus LLRF loop into a transferable cavity engineering record.","scope":"依公開物理原理與官方資料編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是原廠配方、施工圖、設備操作許可或安全程序。數值均為教學假設，需依實際規格重算。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public physics and official sources. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not vendor recipes, construction drawings, operating authorisation or safety procedures. Numbers are teaching assumptions and must be recalculated for real specifications.","subcategory":"optics-accelerators-detectors","subcategoryTitle":"加速器、光束線與粒子偵測器","subcategoryTitleEn":"Accelerators, beamlines and particle detectors","learningTrack":"optics","learningSubdiscipline":"optics-accelerators-detectors","learningTags":["optics","optics-accelerators-detectors","accelerator"],"architectureFamily":"accelerator","architectureNodes":[["速調管或固態放大器","Klystron or solid-state amplifier"],["環形器與波導","Circulator and waveguide"],["輸入耦合器與陶瓷窗","Input coupler and ceramic window"],["銅射頻腔與冷卻","Copper RF cavity and cooling"],["調諧器","Tuner"],["低階射頻控制器","Low-level RF controller"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,1],[1,2],[2,3],[4,3],[3,5],[5,0],[5,4]],"diagram":{"type":"accelerator","labels":["速調管或固態放大器","環形器與波導","輸入耦合器與陶瓷窗","銅射頻腔與冷卻","調諧器"],"labelsEn":["Klystron or solid-state amplifier","Circulator and waveguide","Input coupler and ceramic window","Copper RF cavity and cooling","Tuner"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"500 MHz 儲存環常溫腔設計練習：TM010 半徑 R = 2.405c/(2πf) = 2.405×2.998×10⁸/(2π×5×10⁸) ≈ 0.2295 m。假設 R/Q = 145 Ω、Q0 = 3.5×10⁴，R_sh = 5.08 MΩ；腔壓 V = 0.55 MV 時銅損 P_c = V²/R_sh ≈ 59.6 kW。束流 I0 = 0.3 A、每腔能損 0.20 MV，P_b = 60 kW，最佳耦合 β_opt = 1 + 60/59.6 ≈ 2.01，Q_L = 3.5×10⁴/3.01 ≈ 11 600，半頻寬約 21.5 kHz。cosφs = 0.20/0.55 = 0.364、sinφs = 0.932，tanψ = 0.3×5.08×10⁶×0.932/(3.01×0.55×10⁶) ≈ 0.86，失諧 Δf ≈ 0.86×5×10⁸/(2×11 600) ≈ 18.4 kHz；發電機需 P_g ≈ 119.6 kW，加 25% 控制與波導餘量約 150 kW。空載時 Γ = 1.01/3.01 ≈ 0.33，約 11% 功率被反射。數值為教學假設，不代表任何實機規格。","textEn":"Design exercise for a 500 MHz normal-conducting storage-ring cavity: the TM010 radius is R = 2.405c/(2πf) = 2.405×2.998×10⁸/(2π×5×10⁸) ≈ 0.2295 m. Assuming R/Q = 145 Ω and Q0 = 3.5×10⁴, R_sh = 5.08 MΩ, and a cavity voltage V = 0.55 MV costs P_c = V²/R_sh ≈ 59.6 kW. A beam of I0 = 0.3 A losing 0.20 MV per cavity takes P_b = 60 kW, so β_opt = 1 + 60/59.6 ≈ 2.01, Q_L = 3.5×10⁴/3.01 ≈ 11 600 and the half bandwidth is about 21.5 kHz. With cosφs = 0.20/0.55 = 0.364 and sinφs = 0.932, tanψ = 0.3×5.08×10⁶×0.932/(3.01×0.55×10⁶) ≈ 0.86 and the detuning is Δf ≈ 0.86×5×10⁸/(2×11 600) ≈ 18.4 kHz; the generator must supply P_g ≈ 119.6 kW, about 150 kW with 25% control and waveguide margin. Without beam Γ = 1.01/3.01 ≈ 0.33, so about 11% of the power is reflected. Values are teaching assumptions, not any machine's specification.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表實機量測、產品額定或操作參數；改變系統邊界後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not measured hardware, product ratings or operating parameters; recalculate after changing the system boundary.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與設施背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and facility context, not these numbers."},"depth":4,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":12,"enrichmentVersion":12,"stages":[{"id":"a458-v12-s1","title":"系統邊界與物理原理","titleEn":"System boundaries and physical principles","description":"本階段聚焦「柱形腔 TM010 模態與共振頻率」與「渡越時間因子與能量增益」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"The pillbox TM010 mode and resonant frequency\" and \"Transit-time factor and energy gain\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a458-v12-01","title":"柱形腔 TM010 模態與共振頻率：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"The pillbox TM010 mode and resonant frequency: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「TM010 腔體與軸向電場」如何決定粒子加速器射頻腔的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “TM010 cell and on-axis electric field” determines the key performance of “Particle-accelerator radio-frequency cavities”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"射頻腔是把微波能量儲存在金屬空腔中的共振器，加速用的是 TM010 模態：電場沿束流軸向、在中心最大並沿半徑以貝索函數 J0 遞減，磁場沿方位角繞行並在側壁感應出表面電流。因為電場週期性反向，只有在電場指向前進方向的那半個週期穿過腔體的束團才會被加速，所以束團間距必須是射頻週期的整數倍。理想柱形腔的 TM010 頻率只由半徑決定，與長度無關；實際腔體加上鼻錐與束管後，頻率與場分布要用數值模擬修正。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「TM010 腔體與軸向電場」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"An RF cavity is a resonator that stores microwave energy in a metal enclosure, and acceleration uses the TM010 mode: the electric field points along the beam axis, peaks at the centre and falls radially as the Bessel function J0, while the magnetic field circles azimuthally and drives surface currents in the side wall. Because the field reverses every half period, only bunches crossing the gap while the field points forward are accelerated, so bunch spacing must be an integer number of RF periods. In an ideal pillbox the TM010 frequency depends only on radius, not length; nose cones and beam pipes in a real cell shift frequency and field shape and must be corrected by numerical simulation. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “TM010 cell and on-axis electric field”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：柱形腔 TM010 頻率 f = 2.405·c/(2πR)，2.405 是 J0 的第一個零點。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: The pillbox TM010 frequency is f = 2.405·c/(2πR), where 2.405 is the first zero of J0.","failure":"常見誤解：「把柱形腔做得更長，TM010 的共振頻率就會下降。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Making a pillbox longer lowers its TM010 resonant frequency.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「TM010 腔體與軸向電場」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “TM010 cell and on-axis electric field”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a458-v12-01-k1","title":"柱形腔 TM010 模態與共振頻率","titleEn":"The pillbox TM010 mode and resonant frequency","text":"射頻腔是把微波能量儲存在金屬空腔中的共振器，加速用的是 TM010 模態：電場沿束流軸向、在中心最大並沿半徑以貝索函數 J0 遞減，磁場沿方位角繞行並在側壁感應出表面電流。因為電場週期性反向，只有在電場指向前進方向的那半個週期穿過腔體的束團才會被加速，所以束團間距必須是射頻週期的整數倍。","textEn":"An RF cavity is a resonator that stores microwave energy in a metal enclosure, and acceleration uses the TM010 mode: the electric field points along the beam axis, peaks at the centre and falls radially as the Bessel function J0, while the magnetic field circles azimuthally and drives surface currents in the side wall. Because the field reverses every half period, only bunches crossing the gap while the field points forward are accelerated, so bunch spacing must be an integer number of RF periods.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]},{"id":"a458-v12-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：把柱形腔做得更長，TM010 的共振頻率就會下降。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Making a pillbox longer lowers its TM010 resonant frequency. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「柱形腔 TM010 模態與共振頻率」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"The pillbox TM010 mode and resonant frequency\" is correct?","options":["把柱形腔做得更長，TM010 的共振頻率就會下降。","射頻腔是把微波能量儲存在金屬空腔中的共振器，加速用的是 TM010 模態：電場沿束流軸向、在中心最大並沿半徑以貝索函數 J0 遞減，磁場沿方位角繞行並在側壁感應出表面電流。","間隙越長，粒子在電場中停留越久，能量增益一定越大。"],"optionsEn":["Making a pillbox longer lowers its TM010 resonant frequency.","An RF cavity is a resonator that stores microwave energy in a metal enclosure, and acceleration uses the TM010 mode: the electric field points along the beam axis, peaks at the centre and falls radially as the Bessel function J0, while the magnetic field circles azimuthally and drives surface currents in the side wall.","A longer gap always gives more energy gain because the particle spends longer in the field."],"answer":1,"explanation":"射頻腔是把微波能量儲存在金屬空腔中的共振器，加速用的是 TM010 模態：電場沿束流軸向、在中心最大並沿半徑以貝索函數 J0 遞減，磁場沿方位角繞行並在側壁感應出表面電流。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"An RF cavity is a resonator that stores microwave energy in a metal enclosure, and acceleration uses the TM010 mode: the electric field points along the beam axis, peaks at the centre and falls radially as the Bessel function J0, while the magnetic field circles azimuthally and drives surface currents in the side wall. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"a458-v12-02","title":"柱形腔 TM010 模態與共振頻率：定量估算","titleEn":"The pillbox TM010 mode and resonant frequency: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"],"prerequisiteIds":["a458-v12-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「TM010 腔體與軸向電場」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “TM010 cell and on-axis electric field” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：柱形腔 TM010 頻率 f = 2.405·c/(2πR)，2.405 是 J0 的第一個零點。R = 0.2255 m 時 f = 2.405×2.998×10⁸/(2π×0.2255) ≈ 508.9 MHz；改為 S 頻段 2998 MHz 只需 R ≈ 38.3 mm，因此頻率越高腔體越小、加工公差也越緊。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: The pillbox TM010 frequency is f = 2.405·c/(2πR), where 2.405 is the first zero of J0. With R = 0.2255 m, f = 2.405×2.998×10⁸/(2π×0.2255) ≈ 508.9 MHz; an S-band 2998 MHz cell needs only R ≈ 38.3 mm, so higher frequency means smaller cavities and tighter machining tolerances. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以 2D 或 3D 電磁場本徵模求解器建模實際腔形，先對柱形腔解析解驗證網格收斂（誤差小於 0.1%），再與冷測時網路分析儀量到的 S21 共振峰比較；並以小天線沿軸掃描確認沒有把鄰近的 TM011 或 TE111 模態誤認為加速模。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Model the real cell shape with a 2D or 3D electromagnetic eigenmode solver, first checking mesh convergence against the analytic pillbox result to better than 0.1%, then compare with the S21 resonance measured on a network analyser during cold test; scan a small antenna along the axis to confirm that a neighbouring TM011 or TE111 mode has not been mistaken for the accelerating mode.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a458-v12-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"柱形腔 TM010 頻率 f = 2.405·c/(2πR)，2.405 是 J0 的第一個零點。R = 0.2255 m 時 f = 2.405×2.998×10⁸/(2π×0.2255) ≈ 508.9 MHz；改為 S 頻段 2998 MHz 只需 R ≈ 38.3 mm，因此頻率越高腔體越小、加工公差也越緊。","textEn":"The pillbox TM010 frequency is f = 2.405·c/(2πR), where 2.405 is the first zero of J0. With R = 0.2255 m, f = 2.405×2.998×10⁸/(2π×0.2255) ≈ 508.9 MHz; an S-band 2998 MHz cell needs only R ≈ 38.3 mm, so higher frequency means smaller cavities and tighter machining tolerances.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]},{"id":"a458-v12-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「柱形腔 TM010 模態與共振頻率」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"The pillbox TM010 mode and resonant frequency\", which statement holds?","options":["耦合係數永遠應該設在 β = 1 才是最佳匹配。","腔體只要在冷測時調準頻率，運轉時就不需要再調。","柱形腔 TM010 頻率 f = 2.405·c/(2πR)，2.405 是 J0 的第一個零點。"],"optionsEn":["The coupling factor should always be β = 1 for the best match.","Once tuned at cold test, a cavity needs no tuning in operation.","The pillbox TM010 frequency is f = 2.405·c/(2πR), where 2.405 is the first zero of J0."],"answer":2,"explanation":"柱形腔 TM010 頻率 f = 2.405·c/(2πR)，2.405 是 J0 的第一個零點。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"The pillbox TM010 frequency is f = 2.405·c/(2πR), where 2.405 is the first zero of J0. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"a458-v12-03","title":"柱形腔 TM010 模態與共振頻率：量測與驗證","titleEn":"The pillbox TM010 mode and resonant frequency: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"],"prerequisiteIds":["a458-v12-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「TM010 腔體與軸向電場」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “TM010 cell and on-axis electric field” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以 2D 或 3D 電磁場本徵模求解器建模實際腔形，先對柱形腔解析解驗證網格收斂（誤差小於 0.1%），再與冷測時網路分析儀量到的 S21 共振峰比較；並以小天線沿軸掃描確認沒有把鄰近的 TM011 或 TE111 模態誤認為加速模。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Model the real cell shape with a 2D or 3D electromagnetic eigenmode solver, first checking mesh convergence against the analytic pillbox result to better than 0.1%, then compare with the S21 resonance measured on a network analyser during cold test; scan a small antenna along the axis to confirm that a neighbouring TM011 or TE111 mode has not been mistaken for the accelerating mode. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：若設計時只用柱形腔公式而忽略束管與鼻錐的電容負載，製成的腔體頻率可能偏離數 MHz，超出調諧器數百 kHz 的範圍，只能重新加工或報廢。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Designing from the pillbox formula alone while ignoring the capacitive loading of beam pipes and nose cones can leave the finished cavity several MHz off frequency, far outside a tuner range of a few hundred kHz, forcing re-machining or scrapping.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a458-v12-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以 2D 或 3D 電磁場本徵模求解器建模實際腔形，先對柱形腔解析解驗證網格收斂（誤差小於 0.1%），再與冷測時網路分析儀量到的 S21 共振峰比較；並以小天線沿軸掃描確認沒有把鄰近的 TM011 或 TE111 模態誤認為加速模。","textEn":"Model the real cell shape with a 2D or 3D electromagnetic eigenmode solver, first checking mesh convergence against the analytic pillbox result to better than 0.1%, then compare with the S21 resonance measured on a network analyser during cold test; scan a small antenna along the axis to confirm that a neighbouring TM011 or TE111 mode has not been mistaken for the accelerating mode.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]},{"id":"a458-v12-03-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「柱形腔 TM010 模態與共振頻率」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"The pillbox TM010 mode and resonant frequency\"?","options":["以 2D 或 3D 電磁場本徵模求解器建模實際腔形，先對柱形腔解析解驗證網格收斂（誤差小於 0.1%），再與冷測時網路分析儀量到的 S21 共振峰比較。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","束流只是吸收能量的負載，不會改變腔體的共振條件。"],"optionsEn":["Model the real cell shape with a 2D or 3D electromagnetic eigenmode solver, first checking mesh convergence against the analytic pillbox result to better than 0.1%, then compare with the S21 resonance measured on a network analyser during cold test.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","The beam only absorbs energy and never changes the cavity's resonance condition."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以 2D 或 3D 電磁場本徵模求解器建模實際腔形，先對柱形腔解析解驗證網格收斂（誤差小於 0.1%），再與冷測時網路分析儀量到的 S21 共振峰比較；並以小天線沿軸掃描確認沒有把鄰近的 TM011 或 TE111 模態誤認為加速模。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Model the real cell shape with a 2D or 3D electromagnetic eigenmode solver, first checking mesh convergence against the analytic pillbox result to better than 0.1%, then compare with the S21 resonance measured on a network analyser during cold test; scan a small antenna along the axis to confirm that a neighbouring TM011 or TE111 mode has not been mistaken for the accelerating mode. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"a458-v12-04","title":"柱形腔 TM010 模態與共振頻率：失效診斷","titleEn":"The pillbox TM010 mode and resonant frequency: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"],"prerequisiteIds":["a458-v12-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「TM010 腔體與軸向電場」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “TM010 cell and on-axis electric field” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"若設計時只用柱形腔公式而忽略束管與鼻錐的電容負載，製成的腔體頻率可能偏離數 MHz，超出調諧器數百 kHz 的範圍，只能重新加工或報廢。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Designing from the pillbox formula alone while ignoring the capacitive loading of beam pipes and nose cones can leave the finished cavity several MHz off frequency, far outside a tuner range of a few hundred kHz, forcing re-machining or scrapping. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：理想柱形腔的 TM010 頻率只由半徑決定，與長度無關；實際腔體加上鼻錐與束管後，頻率與場分布要用數值模擬修正。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: In an ideal pillbox the TM010 frequency depends only on radius, not length; nose cones and beam pipes in a real cell shift frequency and field shape and must be corrected by numerical simulation.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「把柱形腔做得更長，TM010 的共振頻率就會下降。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Making a pillbox longer lowers its TM010 resonant frequency.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a458-v12-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若設計時只用柱形腔公式而忽略束管與鼻錐的電容負載，製成的腔體頻率可能偏離數 MHz，超出調諧器數百 kHz 的範圍，只能重新加工或報廢。","textEn":"Designing from the pillbox formula alone while ignoring the capacitive loading of beam pipes and nose cones can leave the finished cavity several MHz off frequency, far outside a tuner range of a few hundred kHz, forcing re-machining or scrapping.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]},{"id":"a458-v12-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「柱形腔 TM010 模態與共振頻率」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"The pillbox TM010 mode and resonant frequency\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","若設計時只用柱形腔公式而忽略束管與鼻錐的電容負載，製成的腔體頻率可能偏離數 MHz，超出調諧器數百 kHz 的範圍，只能重新加工或報廢。","間隙越長，粒子在電場中停留越久，能量增益一定越大。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","Designing from the pillbox formula alone while ignoring the capacitive loading of beam pipes and nose cones can leave the finished cavity several MHz off frequency, far outside a tuner range of a few hundred kHz, forcing re-machining or scrapping.","A longer gap always gives more energy gain because the particle spends longer in the field."],"answer":1,"explanation":"若設計時只用柱形腔公式而忽略束管與鼻錐的電容負載，製成的腔體頻率可能偏離數 MHz，超出調諧器數百 kHz 的範圍，只能重新加工或報廢。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Designing from the pillbox formula alone while ignoring the capacitive loading of beam pipes and nose cones can leave the finished cavity several MHz off frequency, far outside a tuner range of a few hundred kHz, forcing re-machining or scrapping. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"a458-v12-05","title":"渡越時間因子與能量增益：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Transit-time factor and energy gain: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"],"prerequisiteIds":["a458-v12-04"],"objective":"說明「加速間隙與同步相位」如何決定粒子加速器射頻腔的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Accelerating gap and synchronous phase” determines the key performance of “Particle-accelerator radio-frequency cavities”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"粒子穿越間隙需要有限時間，這段時間內電場仍在正弦振盪，所以粒子實際獲得的電壓小於峰值間隙電壓，比例稱為渡越時間因子 T。間隙越長，粒子看到的場相位跨度越大，T 越小；但間隙太短又會提高表面電場並降低分路阻抗，鼻錐形狀就是在兩者間取捨。粒子相對射頻波峰的到達相位 φ 決定能量增益與縱向聚焦：直線加速器常在波峰附近運轉，儲存環則刻意偏離波峰以取得相位穩定。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「加速間隙與同步相位」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A particle needs a finite time to cross the gap while the field keeps oscillating sinusoidally, so the voltage it actually gains is lower than the peak gap voltage by the transit-time factor T. A longer gap spans more RF phase and lowers T, while a very short gap raises the surface field and reduces shunt impedance, and nose-cone shaping is the compromise between the two. The arrival phase φ relative to the RF crest sets both energy gain and longitudinal focusing: linacs often run near crest, whereas storage rings deliberately run off crest to obtain phase stability. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Accelerating gap and synchronous phase”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：能量增益 ΔW = q·V0·T·cosφ，柱形腔 T = sin x / x，x = πg/(βλ)。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Energy gain is ΔW = q·V0·T·cosφ, and for a pillbox T = sin x / x with x = πg/(βλ).","failure":"常見誤解：「間隙越長，粒子在電場中停留越久，能量增益一定越大。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A longer gap always gives more energy gain because the particle spends longer in the field.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「加速間隙與同步相位」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Accelerating gap and synchronous phase”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a458-v12-05-k1","title":"渡越時間因子與能量增益","titleEn":"Transit-time factor and energy gain","text":"粒子穿越間隙需要有限時間，這段時間內電場仍在正弦振盪，所以粒子實際獲得的電壓小於峰值間隙電壓，比例稱為渡越時間因子 T。間隙越長，粒子看到的場相位跨度越大，T 越小；但間隙太短又會提高表面電場並降低分路阻抗，鼻錐形狀就是在兩者間取捨。","textEn":"A particle needs a finite time to cross the gap while the field keeps oscillating sinusoidally, so the voltage it actually gains is lower than the peak gap voltage by the transit-time factor T. A longer gap spans more RF phase and lowers T, while a very short gap raises the surface field and reduces shunt impedance, and nose-cone shaping is the compromise between the two.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]},{"id":"a458-v12-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：間隙越長，粒子在電場中停留越久，能量增益一定越大。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A longer gap always gives more energy gain because the particle spends longer in the field. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「渡越時間因子與能量增益」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Transit-time factor and energy gain\" is correct?","options":["間隙越長，粒子在電場中停留越久，能量增益一定越大。","R/Q 越高代表腔壁材料越好、損耗越低。","粒子穿越間隙需要有限時間，這段時間內電場仍在正弦振盪，所以粒子實際獲得的電壓小於峰值間隙電壓，比例稱為渡越時間因子 T。"],"optionsEn":["A longer gap always gives more energy gain because the particle spends longer in the field.","A higher R/Q means better wall material and lower loss.","A particle needs a finite time to cross the gap while the field keeps oscillating sinusoidally, so the voltage it actually gains is lower than the peak gap voltage by the transit-time factor T."],"answer":2,"explanation":"粒子穿越間隙需要有限時間，這段時間內電場仍在正弦振盪，所以粒子實際獲得的電壓小於峰值間隙電壓，比例稱為渡越時間因子 T。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A particle needs a finite time to cross the gap while the field keeps oscillating sinusoidally, so the voltage it actually gains is lower than the peak gap voltage by the transit-time factor T. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"a458-v12-06","title":"渡越時間因子與能量增益：定量估算","titleEn":"Transit-time factor and energy gain: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"],"prerequisiteIds":["a458-v12-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「加速間隙與同步相位」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Accelerating gap and synchronous phase” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：能量增益 ΔW = q·V0·T·cosφ，柱形腔 T = sin x / x，x = πg/(βλ)。f = 508.9 MHz 時 λ = 0.589 m；β = 1、間隙 g = 0.20 m 得 x = 1.067、T ≈ 0.82；若 g = λ/2 = 0.295 m 則 T = 2/π ≈ 0.64，能量增益少了約 22%。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Energy gain is ΔW = q·V0·T·cosφ, and for a pillbox T = sin x / x with x = πg/(βλ). At f = 508.9 MHz, λ = 0.589 m; for β = 1 and a gap g = 0.20 m, x = 1.067 and T ≈ 0.82, while g = λ/2 = 0.295 m gives T = 2/π ≈ 0.64, about 22% less energy gain. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以模擬取得軸向電場 Ez(z)，用數值積分 ∫Ez(z)·cos(ωz/βc)dz 計算有效電壓，並與 ∫|Ez|dz 比值得到 T；有束流後以能譜儀或束流位置在色散段的偏移量測能量增益對相位的掃描曲線，峰值應落在預期的 V0·T。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Take the on-axis field Ez(z) from simulation and evaluate the effective voltage ∫Ez(z)·cos(ωz/βc)dz numerically, dividing by ∫|Ez|dz to obtain T; with beam, scan energy gain against phase using a spectrometer or the beam position in a dispersive section, and check that the peak equals the expected V0·T.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a458-v12-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"能量增益 ΔW = q·V0·T·cosφ，柱形腔 T = sin x / x，x = πg/(βλ)。f = 508.9 MHz 時 λ = 0.589 m；β = 1、間隙 g = 0.20 m 得 x = 1.067、T ≈ 0.82；若 g = λ/2 = 0.295 m 則 T = 2/π ≈ 0.64，能量增益少了約 22%。","textEn":"Energy gain is ΔW = q·V0·T·cosφ, and for a pillbox T = sin x / x with x = πg/(βλ). At f = 508.9 MHz, λ = 0.589 m; for β = 1 and a gap g = 0.20 m, x = 1.067 and T ≈ 0.82, while g = λ/2 = 0.295 m gives T = 2/π ≈ 0.64, about 22% less energy gain.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]},{"id":"a458-v12-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「渡越時間因子與能量增益」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Transit-time factor and energy gain\", which statement holds?","options":["能量增益 ΔW = q·V0·T·cosφ，柱形腔 T = sin x / x，x = πg/(βλ)。","網路分析儀上看到的頻寬直接就是腔體的 Q0。","束流只是吸收能量的負載，不會改變腔體的共振條件。"],"optionsEn":["Energy gain is ΔW = q·V0·T·cosφ, and for a pillbox T = sin x / x with x = πg/(βλ).","The bandwidth seen on the network analyser directly gives the cavity Q0.","The beam only absorbs energy and never changes the cavity's resonance condition."],"answer":0,"explanation":"能量增益 ΔW = q·V0·T·cosφ，柱形腔 T = sin x / x，x = πg/(βλ)。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Energy gain is ΔW = q·V0·T·cosφ, and for a pillbox T = sin x / x with x = πg/(βλ). Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"a458-v12-07","title":"渡越時間因子與能量增益：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Transit-time factor and energy gain: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"],"prerequisiteIds":["a458-v12-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「加速間隙與同步相位」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Accelerating gap and synchronous phase” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以模擬取得軸向電場 Ez(z)，用數值積分 ∫Ez(z)·cos(ωz/βc)dz 計算有效電壓，並與 ∫|Ez|dz 比值得到 T；有束流後以能譜儀或束流位置在色散段的偏移量測能量增益對相位的掃描曲線，峰值應落在預期的 V0·T。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Take the on-axis field Ez(z) from simulation and evaluate the effective voltage ∫Ez(z)·cos(ωz/βc)dz numerically, dividing by ∫|Ez|dz to obtain T; with beam, scan energy gain against phase using a spectrometer or the beam position in a dispersive section, and check that the peak equals the expected V0·T. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：把間隙電壓直接當成束流獲得的電壓，會高估能量增益約 20% 到 40%，造成下游磁鐵設定錯誤、軌道偏離，並讓儲存環的相位穩定區（射頻桶）比設計小。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Treating gap voltage as beam voltage overestimates energy gain by roughly 20% to 40%, which mis-sets downstream magnets, displaces the orbit and leaves a storage ring with a smaller RF bucket than designed.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a458-v12-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以模擬取得軸向電場 Ez(z)，用數值積分 ∫Ez(z)·cos(ωz/βc)dz 計算有效電壓，並與 ∫|Ez|dz 比值得到 T；有束流後以能譜儀或束流位置在色散段的偏移量測能量增益對相位的掃描曲線，峰值應落在預期的 V0·T。","textEn":"Take the on-axis field Ez(z) from simulation and evaluate the effective voltage ∫Ez(z)·cos(ωz/βc)dz numerically, dividing by ∫|Ez|dz to obtain T; with beam, scan energy gain against phase using a spectrometer or the beam position in a dispersive section, and check that the peak equals the expected V0·T.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]},{"id":"a458-v12-07-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「渡越時間因子與能量增益」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Transit-time factor and energy gain\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","以模擬取得軸向電場 Ez(z)，用數值積分 ∫Ez(z)·cos(ωz/βc)dz 計算有效電壓，並與 ∫|Ez|dz 比值得到 T。","只要速調管輸出功率夠大，腔體場的穩定度自然就夠好。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Take the on-axis field Ez(z) from simulation and evaluate the effective voltage ∫Ez(z)·cos(ωz/βc)dz numerically, dividing by ∫|Ez|dz to obtain T.","If the klystron has enough output power, cavity field stability takes care of itself."],"answer":1,"explanation":"以模擬取得軸向電場 Ez(z)，用數值積分 ∫Ez(z)·cos(ωz/βc)dz 計算有效電壓，並與 ∫|Ez|dz 比值得到 T；有束流後以能譜儀或束流位置在色散段的偏移量測能量增益對相位的掃描曲線，峰值應落在預期的 V0·T。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Take the on-axis field Ez(z) from simulation and evaluate the effective voltage ∫Ez(z)·cos(ωz/βc)dz numerically, dividing by ∫|Ez|dz to obtain T; with beam, scan energy gain against phase using a spectrometer or the beam position in a dispersive section, and check that the peak equals the expected V0·T. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"a458-v12-08","title":"渡越時間因子與能量增益：失效診斷","titleEn":"Transit-time factor and energy gain: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"],"prerequisiteIds":["a458-v12-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「加速間隙與同步相位」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Accelerating gap and synchronous phase” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"把間隙電壓直接當成束流獲得的電壓，會高估能量增益約 20% 到 40%，造成下游磁鐵設定錯誤、軌道偏離，並讓儲存環的相位穩定區（射頻桶）比設計小。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Treating gap voltage as beam voltage overestimates energy gain by roughly 20% to 40%, which mis-sets downstream magnets, displaces the orbit and leaves a storage ring with a smaller RF bucket than designed. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：粒子相對射頻波峰的到達相位 φ 決定能量增益與縱向聚焦：直線加速器常在波峰附近運轉，儲存環則刻意偏離波峰以取得相位穩定。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The arrival phase φ relative to the RF crest sets both energy gain and longitudinal focusing: linacs often run near crest, whereas storage rings deliberately run off crest to obtain phase stability.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「間隙越長，粒子在電場中停留越久，能量增益一定越大。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A longer gap always gives more energy gain because the particle spends longer in the field.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a458-v12-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"把間隙電壓直接當成束流獲得的電壓，會高估能量增益約 20% 到 40%，造成下游磁鐵設定錯誤、軌道偏離，並讓儲存環的相位穩定區（射頻桶）比設計小。","textEn":"Treating gap voltage as beam voltage overestimates energy gain by roughly 20% to 40%, which mis-sets downstream magnets, displaces the orbit and leaves a storage ring with a smaller RF bucket than designed.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]},{"id":"a458-v12-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「渡越時間因子與能量增益」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Transit-time factor and energy gain\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","R/Q 越高代表腔壁材料越好、損耗越低。","把間隙電壓直接當成束流獲得的電壓，會高估能量增益約 20% 到 40%，造成下游磁鐵設定錯誤、軌道偏離，並讓儲存環的相位穩定區（射頻桶）比設計小。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","A higher R/Q means better wall material and lower loss.","Treating gap voltage as beam voltage overestimates energy gain by roughly 20% to 40%, which mis-sets downstream magnets, displaces the orbit and leaves a storage ring with a smaller RF bucket than designed."],"answer":2,"explanation":"把間隙電壓直接當成束流獲得的電壓，會高估能量增益約 20% 到 40%，造成下游磁鐵設定錯誤、軌道偏離，並讓儲存環的相位穩定區（射頻桶）比設計小。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Treating gap voltage as beam voltage overestimates energy gain by roughly 20% to 40%, which mis-sets downstream magnets, displaces the orbit and leaves a storage ring with a smaller RF bucket than designed. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"a458-v12-s2","title":"元件、材料與製造","titleEn":"Components, materials and fabrication","description":"本階段聚焦「銅壁表面電阻、Q0 與分路阻抗」與「輸入耦合器、耦合係數 β 與多重電子倍增」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Copper surface resistance, Q0 and shunt impedance\" and \"Input coupler, coupling factor β and multipacting\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a458-v12-09","title":"銅壁表面電阻、Q0 與分路阻抗：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Copper surface resistance, Q0 and shunt impedance: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"],"prerequisiteIds":["a458-v12-08"],"objective":"說明「無氧銅腔壁與冷卻水道」如何決定粒子加速器射頻腔的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Oxygen-free copper wall and cooling channels” determines the key performance of “Particle-accelerator radio-frequency cavities”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"射頻電流只在腔壁表層的趨膚深度內流動，常溫無氧銅的表面電阻決定了每次振盪損失的能量，也就決定了無載品質因數 Q0。R/Q 只由腔形決定，代表單位儲能能產生多少加速電壓；分路阻抗 R_sh = (R/Q)·Q0 則把腔形與材料損耗合在一起，決定維持某個電壓需要灌入多少瓦的銅損。這些熱量必須由嵌在腔壁的冷卻水道帶走，所以常溫腔設計同時是射頻問題也是熱工問題。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「無氧銅腔壁與冷卻水道」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"RF currents flow only within the skin depth of the wall, and the surface resistance of room-temperature oxygen-free copper sets the energy lost per cycle and therefore the unloaded quality factor Q0. R/Q depends only on geometry and expresses how much accelerating voltage a given stored energy produces, while the shunt impedance R_sh = (R/Q)·Q0 combines geometry with material loss and sets how many watts of copper loss are needed to hold a voltage. That heat must be carried away by water channels in the wall, so a normal-conducting cavity is a thermal design as much as an RF design. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Oxygen-free copper wall and cooling channels”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：Rs = √(ωμ0/2σ)，銅 σ = 5.8×10⁷ S/m、f = 508.9 MHz 時趨膚深度約 2.9 µm、Rs ≈ 5.9 mΩ；取幾何因子 G ≈ 200 Ω，Q0 = G/Rs ≈ 3.4×10⁴。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Rs = √(ωμ0/2σ); for copper with σ = 5.8×10⁷ S/m at 508.9 MHz the skin depth is about 2.9 µm and Rs ≈ 5.9 mΩ, and with a geometry factor G ≈ 200 Ω, Q0 = G/Rs ≈ 3.4×10⁴.","failure":"常見誤解：「R/Q 越高代表腔壁材料越好、損耗越低。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A higher R/Q means better wall material and lower loss.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「無氧銅腔壁與冷卻水道」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Oxygen-free copper wall and cooling channels”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a458-v12-09-k1","title":"銅壁表面電阻、Q0 與分路阻抗","titleEn":"Copper surface resistance, Q0 and shunt impedance","text":"射頻電流只在腔壁表層的趨膚深度內流動，常溫無氧銅的表面電阻決定了每次振盪損失的能量，也就決定了無載品質因數 Q0。R/Q 只由腔形決定，代表單位儲能能產生多少加速電壓；分路阻抗 R_sh = (R/Q)·Q0 則把腔形與材料損耗合在一起，決定維持某個電壓需要灌入多少瓦的銅損。","textEn":"RF currents flow only within the skin depth of the wall, and the surface resistance of room-temperature oxygen-free copper sets the energy lost per cycle and therefore the unloaded quality factor Q0. R/Q depends only on geometry and expresses how much accelerating voltage a given stored energy produces, while the shunt impedance R_sh = (R/Q)·Q0 combines geometry with material loss and sets how many watts of copper loss are needed to hold a voltage.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]},{"id":"a458-v12-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：R/Q 越高代表腔壁材料越好、損耗越低。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A higher R/Q means better wall material and lower loss. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「銅壁表面電阻、Q0 與分路阻抗」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Copper surface resistance, Q0 and shunt impedance\" is correct?","options":["射頻電流只在腔壁表層的趨膚深度內流動，常溫無氧銅的表面電阻決定了每次振盪損失的能量，也就決定了無載品質因數 Q0。","R/Q 越高代表腔壁材料越好、損耗越低。","耦合係數永遠應該設在 β = 1 才是最佳匹配。"],"optionsEn":["RF currents flow only within the skin depth of the wall, and the surface resistance of room-temperature oxygen-free copper sets the energy lost per cycle and therefore the unloaded quality factor Q0.","A higher R/Q means better wall material and lower loss.","The coupling factor should always be β = 1 for the best match."],"answer":0,"explanation":"射頻電流只在腔壁表層的趨膚深度內流動，常溫無氧銅的表面電阻決定了每次振盪損失的能量，也就決定了無載品質因數 Q0。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"RF currents flow only within the skin depth of the wall, and the surface resistance of room-temperature oxygen-free copper sets the energy lost per cycle and therefore the unloaded quality factor Q0. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"a458-v12-10","title":"銅壁表面電阻、Q0 與分路阻抗：定量估算","titleEn":"Copper surface resistance, Q0 and shunt impedance: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"],"prerequisiteIds":["a458-v12-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「無氧銅腔壁與冷卻水道」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Oxygen-free copper wall and cooling channels” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：Rs = √(ωμ0/2σ)，銅 σ = 5.8×10⁷ S/m、f = 508.9 MHz 時趨膚深度約 2.9 µm、Rs ≈ 5.9 mΩ；取幾何因子 G ≈ 200 Ω，Q0 = G/Rs ≈ 3.4×10⁴。若 R/Q = 150 Ω、Q0 = 3.3×10⁴，R_sh ≈ 5.0 MΩ，V = 0.6 MV 時 P = V²/R_sh ≈ 72 kW；冷卻水溫升 5 K 需流量 ≈ 72000/(4186×5) ≈ 3.5 kg/s，約 210 L/min。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Rs = √(ωμ0/2σ); for copper with σ = 5.8×10⁷ S/m at 508.9 MHz the skin depth is about 2.9 µm and Rs ≈ 5.9 mΩ, and with a geometry factor G ≈ 200 Ω, Q0 = G/Rs ≈ 3.4×10⁴. With R/Q = 150 Ω and Q0 = 3.3×10⁴, R_sh ≈ 5.0 MΩ and holding V = 0.6 MV costs P = V²/R_sh ≈ 72 kW; a 5 K water temperature rise needs ≈ 72000/(4186×5) ≈ 3.5 kg/s, about 210 L/min. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：冷測時由網路分析儀量 Q0 並與 G/Rs 的理論值比較，比值通常落在 90% 到 95%，差距反映表面粗糙、硬焊接縫與氧化；高功率測試時以進出水溫差乘以流量做量熱，與 V²/R_sh 預測的銅損比對，兩者差異超過 5% 就要追查電壓刻度或熱損路徑。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: During cold test measure Q0 with a network analyser and compare with the theoretical G/Rs, typically finding 90% to 95% of theory, the shortfall reflecting roughness, brazed joints and oxidation; at high power perform calorimetry from the water temperature rise times flow and compare with the V²/R_sh loss, chasing the voltage calibration or heat paths if they differ by more than 5%.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a458-v12-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"Rs = √(ωμ0/2σ)，銅 σ = 5.8×10⁷ S/m、f = 508.9 MHz 時趨膚深度約 2.9 µm、Rs ≈ 5.9 mΩ；取幾何因子 G ≈ 200 Ω，Q0 = G/Rs ≈ 3.4×10⁴。若 R/Q = 150 Ω、Q0 = 3.3×10⁴，R_sh ≈ 5.0 MΩ，V = 0.6 MV 時 P = V²/R_sh ≈ 72 kW；冷卻水溫升 5 K 需流量 ≈ 72000/(4186×5) ≈ 3.5 kg/s，約 210 L/min。","textEn":"Rs = √(ωμ0/2σ); for copper with σ = 5.8×10⁷ S/m at 508.9 MHz the skin depth is about 2.9 µm and Rs ≈ 5.9 mΩ, and with a geometry factor G ≈ 200 Ω, Q0 = G/Rs ≈ 3.4×10⁴. With R/Q = 150 Ω and Q0 = 3.3×10⁴, R_sh ≈ 5.0 MΩ and holding V = 0.6 MV costs P = V²/R_sh ≈ 72 kW; a 5 K water temperature rise needs ≈ 72000/(4186×5) ≈ 3.5 kg/s, about 210 L/min.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]},{"id":"a458-v12-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「銅壁表面電阻、Q0 與分路阻抗」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Copper surface resistance, Q0 and shunt impedance\", which statement holds?","options":["腔體只要在冷測時調準頻率，運轉時就不需要再調。","Rs = √(ωμ0/2σ)，銅 σ = 5.8×10⁷ S/m、f = 508.9 MHz 時趨膚深度約 2.9 µm、Rs ≈ 5.9 mΩ。","只要速調管輸出功率夠大，腔體場的穩定度自然就夠好。"],"optionsEn":["Once tuned at cold test, a cavity needs no tuning in operation.","Rs = √(ωμ0/2σ).","If the klystron has enough output power, cavity field stability takes care of itself."],"answer":1,"explanation":"Rs = √(ωμ0/2σ)，銅 σ = 5.8×10⁷ S/m、f = 508.9 MHz 時趨膚深度約 2.9 µm、Rs ≈ 5.9 mΩ；取幾何因子 G ≈ 200 Ω，Q0 = G/Rs ≈ 3.4×10⁴。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Rs = √(ωμ0/2σ); for copper with σ = 5.8×10⁷ S/m at 508.9 MHz the skin depth is about 2.9 µm and Rs ≈ 5.9 mΩ, and with a geometry factor G ≈ 200 Ω, Q0 = G/Rs ≈ 3.4×10⁴. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"a458-v12-11","title":"銅壁表面電阻、Q0 與分路阻抗：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Copper surface resistance, Q0 and shunt impedance: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"],"prerequisiteIds":["a458-v12-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「無氧銅腔壁與冷卻水道」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Oxygen-free copper wall and cooling channels” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"冷測時由網路分析儀量 Q0 並與 G/Rs 的理論值比較，比值通常落在 90% 到 95%，差距反映表面粗糙、硬焊接縫與氧化；高功率測試時以進出水溫差乘以流量做量熱，與 V²/R_sh 預測的銅損比對，兩者差異超過 5% 就要追查電壓刻度或熱損路徑。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"During cold test measure Q0 with a network analyser and compare with the theoretical G/Rs, typically finding 90% to 95% of theory, the shortfall reflecting roughness, brazed joints and oxidation; at high power perform calorimetry from the water temperature rise times flow and compare with the V²/R_sh loss, chasing the voltage calibration or heat paths if they differ by more than 5%. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：冷卻水道局部堵塞或流量分配不均，會在磁場最強的側壁形成熱點，局部膨脹使頻率漂移並造成表面疲勞裂紋，長期運轉後可能出現真空洩漏。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: A partially blocked channel or poorly balanced flow creates a hot spot on the high-magnetic-field side wall, where local expansion drifts the frequency and cyclic stress cracks the surface, eventually leading to a vacuum leak after long operation.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a458-v12-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"冷測時由網路分析儀量 Q0 並與 G/Rs 的理論值比較，比值通常落在 90% 到 95%，差距反映表面粗糙、硬焊接縫與氧化；高功率測試時以進出水溫差乘以流量做量熱，與 V²/R_sh 預測的銅損比對，兩者差異超過 5% 就要追查電壓刻度或熱損路徑。","textEn":"During cold test measure Q0 with a network analyser and compare with the theoretical G/Rs, typically finding 90% to 95% of theory, the shortfall reflecting roughness, brazed joints and oxidation; at high power perform calorimetry from the water temperature rise times flow and compare with the V²/R_sh loss, chasing the voltage calibration or heat paths if they differ by more than 5%.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]},{"id":"a458-v12-11-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「銅壁表面電阻、Q0 與分路阻抗」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Copper surface resistance, Q0 and shunt impedance\"?","options":["只看單次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準件或重複量測。","把柱形腔做得更長，TM010 的共振頻率就會下降。","冷測時由網路分析儀量 Q0 並與 G/Rs 的理論值比較，比值通常落在 90% 到 95%，差距反映表面粗糙、硬焊接縫與氧化。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the result; no reference artefact or repeat measurement is needed.","Making a pillbox longer lowers its TM010 resonant frequency.","During cold test measure Q0 with a network analyser and compare with the theoretical G/Rs, typically finding 90% to 95% of theory, the shortfall reflecting roughness, brazed joints and oxidation."],"answer":2,"explanation":"冷測時由網路分析儀量 Q0 並與 G/Rs 的理論值比較，比值通常落在 90% 到 95%，差距反映表面粗糙、硬焊接縫與氧化；高功率測試時以進出水溫差乘以流量做量熱，與 V²/R_sh 預測的銅損比對，兩者差異超過 5% 就要追查電壓刻度或熱損路徑。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"During cold test measure Q0 with a network analyser and compare with the theoretical G/Rs, typically finding 90% to 95% of theory, the shortfall reflecting roughness, brazed joints and oxidation; at high power perform calorimetry from the water temperature rise times flow and compare with the V²/R_sh loss, chasing the voltage calibration or heat paths if they differ by more than 5%. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"a458-v12-12","title":"銅壁表面電阻、Q0 與分路阻抗：失效診斷","titleEn":"Copper surface resistance, Q0 and shunt impedance: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"],"prerequisiteIds":["a458-v12-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「無氧銅腔壁與冷卻水道」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Oxygen-free copper wall and cooling channels” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"冷卻水道局部堵塞或流量分配不均，會在磁場最強的側壁形成熱點，局部膨脹使頻率漂移並造成表面疲勞裂紋，長期運轉後可能出現真空洩漏。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"A partially blocked channel or poorly balanced flow creates a hot spot on the high-magnetic-field side wall, where local expansion drifts the frequency and cyclic stress cracks the surface, eventually leading to a vacuum leak after long operation. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：這些熱量必須由嵌在腔壁的冷卻水道帶走，所以常溫腔設計同時是射頻問題也是熱工問題。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: That heat must be carried away by water channels in the wall, so a normal-conducting cavity is a thermal design as much as an RF design.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「R/Q 越高代表腔壁材料越好、損耗越低。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A higher R/Q means better wall material and lower loss.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a458-v12-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"冷卻水道局部堵塞或流量分配不均，會在磁場最強的側壁形成熱點，局部膨脹使頻率漂移並造成表面疲勞裂紋，長期運轉後可能出現真空洩漏。","textEn":"A partially blocked channel or poorly balanced flow creates a hot spot on the high-magnetic-field side wall, where local expansion drifts the frequency and cyclic stress cracks the surface, eventually leading to a vacuum leak after long operation.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]},{"id":"a458-v12-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「銅壁表面電阻、Q0 與分路阻抗」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Copper surface resistance, Q0 and shunt impedance\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["冷卻水道局部堵塞或流量分配不均，會在磁場最強的側壁形成熱點，局部膨脹使頻率漂移並造成表面疲勞裂紋，長期運轉後可能出現真空洩漏。","異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","耦合係數永遠應該設在 β = 1 才是最佳匹配。"],"optionsEn":["A partially blocked channel or poorly balanced flow creates a hot spot on the high-magnetic-field side wall, where local expansion drifts the frequency and cyclic stress cracks the surface, eventually leading to a vacuum leak after long operation.","An anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","The coupling factor should always be β = 1 for the best match."],"answer":0,"explanation":"冷卻水道局部堵塞或流量分配不均，會在磁場最強的側壁形成熱點，局部膨脹使頻率漂移並造成表面疲勞裂紋，長期運轉後可能出現真空洩漏。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A partially blocked channel or poorly balanced flow creates a hot spot on the high-magnetic-field side wall, where local expansion drifts the frequency and cyclic stress cracks the surface, eventually leading to a vacuum leak after long operation. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"a458-v12-13","title":"輸入耦合器、耦合係數 β 與多重電子倍增：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Input coupler, coupling factor β and multipacting: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"],"prerequisiteIds":["a458-v12-12"],"objective":"說明「輸入耦合器與陶瓷窗」如何決定粒子加速器射頻腔的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Input coupler and ceramic window” determines the key performance of “Particle-accelerator radio-frequency cavities”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"功率由波導或同軸線經耦合環或耦合孔送入腔體，耦合強度以 β = Q0/Q_ext 表示：β = 1 時無束流的腔體對源完全匹配，β > 1 為過耦合。真空與大氣之間由氧化鋁陶瓷窗隔開，窗面常鍍數奈米氮化鈦以降低二次電子發射係數。耦合器與窗是多重電子倍增最容易發生的地方：電子在 RF 場中來回撞擊表面，若二次電子產額大於 1 且飛行時間與射頻週期同步，電流就會雪崩式增加並加熱或擊穿窗片，因此新腔需要逐步升功率的老練。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「輸入耦合器與陶瓷窗」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Power enters through a waveguide or coaxial line via a coupling loop or iris, and the coupling strength is β = Q0/Q_ext: at β = 1 an unloaded cavity is perfectly matched to the source, and β > 1 is over-coupled. An alumina ceramic window separates vacuum from air, often coated with a few nanometres of titanium nitride to lower secondary-electron yield. Couplers and windows are where multipacting is most likely: electrons strike surfaces repeatedly in the RF field, and when the secondary yield exceeds one and the flight time is synchronous with the RF period, current avalanches and can heat or puncture the window, which is why a new cavity is conditioned by raising power in steps. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Input coupler and ceramic window”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：無束流時反射係數 Γ = (β − 1)/(β + 1)。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Without beam the reflection coefficient is Γ = (β − 1)/(β + 1).","failure":"常見誤解：「耦合係數永遠應該設在 β = 1 才是最佳匹配。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"The coupling factor should always be β = 1 for the best match.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「輸入耦合器與陶瓷窗」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Input coupler and ceramic window”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a458-v12-13-k1","title":"輸入耦合器、耦合係數 β 與多重電子倍增","titleEn":"Input coupler, coupling factor β and multipacting","text":"功率由波導或同軸線經耦合環或耦合孔送入腔體，耦合強度以 β = Q0/Q_ext 表示：β = 1 時無束流的腔體對源完全匹配，β > 1 為過耦合。真空與大氣之間由氧化鋁陶瓷窗隔開，窗面常鍍數奈米氮化鈦以降低二次電子發射係數。","textEn":"Power enters through a waveguide or coaxial line via a coupling loop or iris, and the coupling strength is β = Q0/Q_ext: at β = 1 an unloaded cavity is perfectly matched to the source, and β > 1 is over-coupled. An alumina ceramic window separates vacuum from air, often coated with a few nanometres of titanium nitride to lower secondary-electron yield.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]},{"id":"a458-v12-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：耦合係數永遠應該設在 β = 1 才是最佳匹配。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: The coupling factor should always be β = 1 for the best match. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「輸入耦合器、耦合係數 β 與多重電子倍增」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Input coupler, coupling factor β and multipacting\" is correct?","options":["耦合係數永遠應該設在 β = 1 才是最佳匹配。","功率由波導或同軸線經耦合環或耦合孔送入腔體，耦合強度以 β = Q0/Q_ext 表示：β = 1 時無束流的腔體對源完全匹配，β > 1 為過耦合。","網路分析儀上看到的頻寬直接就是腔體的 Q0。"],"optionsEn":["The coupling factor should always be β = 1 for the best match.","Power enters through a waveguide or coaxial line via a coupling loop or iris, and the coupling strength is β = Q0/Q_ext: at β = 1 an unloaded cavity is perfectly matched to the source, and β > 1 is over-coupled.","The bandwidth seen on the network analyser directly gives the cavity Q0."],"answer":1,"explanation":"功率由波導或同軸線經耦合環或耦合孔送入腔體，耦合強度以 β = Q0/Q_ext 表示：β = 1 時無束流的腔體對源完全匹配，β > 1 為過耦合。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Power enters through a waveguide or coaxial line via a coupling loop or iris, and the coupling strength is β = Q0/Q_ext: at β = 1 an unloaded cavity is perfectly matched to the source, and β > 1 is over-coupled. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"a458-v12-14","title":"輸入耦合器、耦合係數 β 與多重電子倍增：定量估算","titleEn":"Input coupler, coupling factor β and multipacting: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"],"prerequisiteIds":["a458-v12-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「輸入耦合器與陶瓷窗」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Input coupler and ceramic window” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：無束流時反射係數 Γ = (β − 1)/(β + 1)。若為了滿載束流把 β 設在 2.39，空載時 Γ = 1.39/3.39 ≈ 0.41，約 16.8% 的入射功率被反射；以銅損 72 kW 計，反射功率約 14.5 kW，必須由環形器與假負載吸收。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Without beam the reflection coefficient is Γ = (β − 1)/(β + 1). If β is set to 2.39 for full beam current, the empty cavity gives Γ = 1.39/3.39 ≈ 0.41 and reflects about 16.8% of the incident power; with 72 kW of wall loss the reflected power is about 14.5 kW, which a circulator and dummy load must absorb. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以網路分析儀在共振頻率量 S11 的大小與相位，於 Smith 圖上判斷過耦合或欠耦合並算出 β；老練時同時記錄真空壓力、窗溫紅外影像、電子拾取探針與反射功率，確認在每個功率階段沒有持續的多重電子倍增訊號才往上加功率。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure the magnitude and phase of S11 at resonance with a network analyser and read over- or under-coupling from the Smith chart to compute β; during conditioning log vacuum pressure, infrared window temperature, electron-pickup probes and reflected power together, and raise power only when no persistent multipacting signature remains at each level.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a458-v12-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"無束流時反射係數 Γ = (β − 1)/(β + 1)。若為了滿載束流把 β 設在 2.39，空載時 Γ = 1.39/3.39 ≈ 0.41，約 16.8% 的入射功率被反射；以銅損 72 kW 計，反射功率約 14.5 kW，必須由環形器與假負載吸收。","textEn":"Without beam the reflection coefficient is Γ = (β − 1)/(β + 1). If β is set to 2.39 for full beam current, the empty cavity gives Γ = 1.39/3.39 ≈ 0.41 and reflects about 16.8% of the incident power; with 72 kW of wall loss the reflected power is about 14.5 kW, which a circulator and dummy load must absorb.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]},{"id":"a458-v12-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「輸入耦合器、耦合係數 β 與多重電子倍增」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Input coupler, coupling factor β and multipacting\", which statement holds?","options":["束流只是吸收能量的負載，不會改變腔體的共振條件。","把柱形腔做得更長，TM010 的共振頻率就會下降。","無束流時反射係數 Γ = (β − 1)/(β + 1)。"],"optionsEn":["The beam only absorbs energy and never changes the cavity's resonance condition.","Making a pillbox longer lowers its TM010 resonant frequency.","Without beam the reflection coefficient is Γ = (β − 1)/(β + 1)."],"answer":2,"explanation":"無束流時反射係數 Γ = (β − 1)/(β + 1)。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Without beam the reflection coefficient is Γ = (β − 1)/(β + 1). Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"a458-v12-15","title":"輸入耦合器、耦合係數 β 與多重電子倍增：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Input coupler, coupling factor β and multipacting: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"],"prerequisiteIds":["a458-v12-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「輸入耦合器與陶瓷窗」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Input coupler and ceramic window” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以網路分析儀在共振頻率量 S11 的大小與相位，於 Smith 圖上判斷過耦合或欠耦合並算出 β；老練時同時記錄真空壓力、窗溫紅外影像、電子拾取探針與反射功率，確認在每個功率階段沒有持續的多重電子倍增訊號才往上加功率。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure the magnitude and phase of S11 at resonance with a network analyser and read over- or under-coupling from the Smith chart to compute β; during conditioning log vacuum pressure, infrared window temperature, electron-pickup probes and reflected power together, and raise power only when no persistent multipacting signature remains at each level. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：窗片鍍層不足或老練過快時，多重電子倍增使窗片局部過熱產生熱應力裂紋，真空瞬間破壞並污染整個腔體與相鄰束管，需要長時間停機更換與重新烘烤。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: With an inadequate window coating or overly fast conditioning, multipacting overheats the window locally until thermal stress cracks it, breaking vacuum and contaminating the cavity and adjacent beam pipe, forcing a long shutdown for replacement and rebake.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a458-v12-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以網路分析儀在共振頻率量 S11 的大小與相位，於 Smith 圖上判斷過耦合或欠耦合並算出 β；老練時同時記錄真空壓力、窗溫紅外影像、電子拾取探針與反射功率，確認在每個功率階段沒有持續的多重電子倍增訊號才往上加功率。","textEn":"Measure the magnitude and phase of S11 at resonance with a network analyser and read over- or under-coupling from the Smith chart to compute β; during conditioning log vacuum pressure, infrared window temperature, electron-pickup probes and reflected power together, and raise power only when no persistent multipacting signature remains at each level.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]},{"id":"a458-v12-15-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「輸入耦合器、耦合係數 β 與多重電子倍增」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Input coupler, coupling factor β and multipacting\"?","options":["以網路分析儀在共振頻率量 S11 的大小與相位，於 Smith 圖上判斷過耦合或欠耦合並算出 β。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","間隙越長，粒子在電場中停留越久，能量增益一定越大。"],"optionsEn":["Measure the magnitude and phase of S11 at resonance with a network analyser and read over- or under-coupling from the Smith chart to compute β.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","A longer gap always gives more energy gain because the particle spends longer in the field."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以網路分析儀在共振頻率量 S11 的大小與相位，於 Smith 圖上判斷過耦合或欠耦合並算出 β；老練時同時記錄真空壓力、窗溫紅外影像、電子拾取探針與反射功率，確認在每個功率階段沒有持續的多重電子倍增訊號才往上加功率。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure the magnitude and phase of S11 at resonance with a network analyser and read over- or under-coupling from the Smith chart to compute β; during conditioning log vacuum pressure, infrared window temperature, electron-pickup probes and reflected power together, and raise power only when no persistent multipacting signature remains at each level. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"a458-v12-16","title":"輸入耦合器、耦合係數 β 與多重電子倍增：失效診斷","titleEn":"Input coupler, coupling factor β and multipacting: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"],"prerequisiteIds":["a458-v12-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「輸入耦合器與陶瓷窗」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Input coupler and ceramic window” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"窗片鍍層不足或老練過快時，多重電子倍增使窗片局部過熱產生熱應力裂紋，真空瞬間破壞並污染整個腔體與相鄰束管，需要長時間停機更換與重新烘烤。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"With an inadequate window coating or overly fast conditioning, multipacting overheats the window locally until thermal stress cracks it, breaking vacuum and contaminating the cavity and adjacent beam pipe, forcing a long shutdown for replacement and rebake. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：耦合器與窗是多重電子倍增最容易發生的地方：電子在 RF 場中來回撞擊表面，若二次電子產額大於 1 且飛行時間與射頻週期同步，電流就會雪崩式增加並加熱或擊穿窗片，因此新腔需要逐步升功率的老練。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Couplers and windows are where multipacting is most likely: electrons strike surfaces repeatedly in the RF field, and when the secondary yield exceeds one and the flight time is synchronous with the RF period, current avalanches and can heat or puncture the window, which is why a new cavity is conditioned by raising power in steps.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「耦合係數永遠應該設在 β = 1 才是最佳匹配。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"The coupling factor should always be β = 1 for the best match.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a458-v12-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"窗片鍍層不足或老練過快時，多重電子倍增使窗片局部過熱產生熱應力裂紋，真空瞬間破壞並污染整個腔體與相鄰束管，需要長時間停機更換與重新烘烤。","textEn":"With an inadequate window coating or overly fast conditioning, multipacting overheats the window locally until thermal stress cracks it, breaking vacuum and contaminating the cavity and adjacent beam pipe, forcing a long shutdown for replacement and rebake.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]},{"id":"a458-v12-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「輸入耦合器、耦合係數 β 與多重電子倍增」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Input coupler, coupling factor β and multipacting\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的零件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","窗片鍍層不足或老練過快時，多重電子倍增使窗片局部過熱產生熱應力裂紋，真空瞬間破壞並污染整個腔體與相鄰束管，需要長時間停機更換與重新烘烤。","網路分析儀上看到的頻寬直接就是腔體的 Q0。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive part first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","With an inadequate window coating or overly fast conditioning, multipacting overheats the window locally until thermal stress cracks it, breaking vacuum and contaminating the cavity and adjacent beam pipe, forcing a long shutdown for replacement and rebake.","The bandwidth seen on the network analyser directly gives the cavity Q0."],"answer":1,"explanation":"窗片鍍層不足或老練過快時，多重電子倍增使窗片局部過熱產生熱應力裂紋，真空瞬間破壞並污染整個腔體與相鄰束管，需要長時間停機更換與重新烘烤。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"With an inadequate window coating or overly fast conditioning, multipacting overheats the window locally until thermal stress cracks it, breaking vacuum and contaminating the cavity and adjacent beam pipe, forcing a long shutdown for replacement and rebake. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"a458-v12-s3","title":"量測、校正與誤差預算","titleEn":"Measurement, calibration and error budgets","description":"本階段聚焦「冷測：Q 值、β 與珠拉場分布量測」與「加工公差、熱失諧與調諧範圍預算」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Cold test: Q, β and bead-pull field mapping\" and \"Machining tolerance, thermal detuning and the tuning-range budget\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a458-v12-17","title":"冷測：Q 值、β 與珠拉場分布量測：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Cold test: Q, β and bead-pull field mapping: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"],"prerequisiteIds":["a458-v12-16"],"objective":"說明「網路分析儀與珠拉台」如何決定粒子加速器射頻腔的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Network analyser and bead-pull bench” determines the key performance of “Particle-accelerator radio-frequency cavities”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"冷測是在低功率下用網路分析儀把腔體當成被動共振器量測：S21 的 3 dB 頻寬給出有載 Q_L，S11 在共振點的大小與相位給出 β，兩者合起來反推 Q0 與 Q_ext。場分布以珠拉法量測：把小金屬或介電珠沿軸拉過腔體，依 Slater 微擾理論，珠子所在處的電場平方正比於共振頻率位移，由此重建 Ez(z) 並計算 R/Q 與多腔結構的場平坦度。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「網路分析儀與珠拉台」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Cold test measures the cavity as a passive resonator at low power with a network analyser: the 3 dB bandwidth of S21 gives the loaded Q_L, and the magnitude and phase of S11 at resonance give β, together yielding Q0 and Q_ext. The field profile is mapped by the bead-pull method: a small metal or dielectric bead is drawn along the axis and, by Slater perturbation theory, the square of the electric field at the bead is proportional to the resonant-frequency shift, from which Ez(z), R/Q and the field flatness of multi-cell structures are reconstructed. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Network analyser and bead-pull bench”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：有載品質因數 Q_L = f0/Δf_3dB。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: The loaded quality factor is Q_L = f0/Δf_3dB.","failure":"常見誤解：「網路分析儀上看到的頻寬直接就是腔體的 Q0。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"The bandwidth seen on the network analyser directly gives the cavity Q0.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「網路分析儀與珠拉台」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Network analyser and bead-pull bench”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a458-v12-17-k1","title":"冷測：Q 值、β 與珠拉場分布量測","titleEn":"Cold test: Q, β and bead-pull field mapping","text":"冷測是在低功率下用網路分析儀把腔體當成被動共振器量測：S21 的 3 dB 頻寬給出有載 Q_L，S11 在共振點的大小與相位給出 β，兩者合起來反推 Q0 與 Q_ext。場分布以珠拉法量測：把小金屬或介電珠沿軸拉過腔體，依 Slater 微擾理論，珠子所在處的電場平方正比於共振頻率位移，由此重建 Ez(z) 並計算 R/Q 與多腔結構的場平坦度。","textEn":"Cold test measures the cavity as a passive resonator at low power with a network analyser: the 3 dB bandwidth of S21 gives the loaded Q_L, and the magnitude and phase of S11 at resonance give β, together yielding Q0 and Q_ext. The field profile is mapped by the bead-pull method: a small metal or dielectric bead is drawn along the axis and, by Slater perturbation theory, the square of the electric field at the bead is proportional to the resonant-frequency shift, from which Ez(z), R/Q and the field flatness of multi-cell structures are reconstructed.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]},{"id":"a458-v12-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：網路分析儀上看到的頻寬直接就是腔體的 Q0。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: The bandwidth seen on the network analyser directly gives the cavity Q0. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「冷測：Q 值、β 與珠拉場分布量測」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Cold test: Q, β and bead-pull field mapping\" is correct?","options":["網路分析儀上看到的頻寬直接就是腔體的 Q0。","腔體只要在冷測時調準頻率，運轉時就不需要再調。","冷測是在低功率下用網路分析儀把腔體當成被動共振器量測：S21 的 3 dB 頻寬給出有載 Q_L，S11 在共振點的大小與相位給出 β，兩者合起來反推 Q0 與 Q_ext。"],"optionsEn":["The bandwidth seen on the network analyser directly gives the cavity Q0.","Once tuned at cold test, a cavity needs no tuning in operation.","Cold test measures the cavity as a passive resonator at low power with a network analyser: the 3 dB bandwidth of S21 gives the loaded Q_L, and the magnitude and phase of S11 at resonance give β, together yielding Q0 and Q_ext."],"answer":2,"explanation":"冷測是在低功率下用網路分析儀把腔體當成被動共振器量測：S21 的 3 dB 頻寬給出有載 Q_L，S11 在共振點的大小與相位給出 β，兩者合起來反推 Q0 與 Q_ext。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Cold test measures the cavity as a passive resonator at low power with a network analyser: the 3 dB bandwidth of S21 gives the loaded Q_L, and the magnitude and phase of S11 at resonance give β, together yielding Q0 and Q_ext. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"a458-v12-18","title":"冷測：Q 值、β 與珠拉場分布量測：定量估算","titleEn":"Cold test: Q, β and bead-pull field mapping: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"],"prerequisiteIds":["a458-v12-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「網路分析儀與珠拉台」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Network analyser and bead-pull bench” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：有載品質因數 Q_L = f0/Δf_3dB。量得 f0 = 500.00 MHz、Δf_3dB = 30.3 kHz，得 Q_L ≈ 16 500；共振時 |S11| = 0.2 且由相位判定為過耦合，β = (1 + 0.2)/(1 − 0.2) = 1.5，因此 Q0 = Q_L(1 + β) ≈ 41 300，外部品質因數 Q_ext = Q0/β ≈ 27 500。若誤判為欠耦合，β = 0.67、Q0 ≈ 27 500，差了三分之一。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: The loaded quality factor is Q_L = f0/Δf_3dB. Measuring f0 = 500.00 MHz and Δf_3dB = 30.3 kHz gives Q_L ≈ 16 500; with |S11| = 0.2 at resonance identified from its phase as over-coupled, β = (1 + 0.2)/(1 − 0.2) = 1.5, so Q0 = Q_L(1 + β) ≈ 41 300 and the external quality factor is Q_ext = Q0/β ≈ 27 500. Misreading it as under-coupled gives β = 0.67 and Q0 ≈ 27 500, one third lower. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：先以校正件做網路分析儀的完整雙埠校正並把參考面移到耦合器法蘭；珠拉時以已知尺寸的金屬珠在柱形校正腔中量出形狀因子，再量待測腔，並重複拉珠三次確認頻率位移的重現性與室溫漂移扣除後的殘差小於 1%。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Perform a full two-port calibration of the network analyser with standards and move the reference plane to the coupler flange; for bead pulls, determine the bead form factor with a known metal bead in a pillbox reference cavity before measuring the cavity under test, repeat each pull three times and confirm that the frequency-shift residual after subtracting room-temperature drift is below 1%.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a458-v12-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"有載品質因數 Q_L = f0/Δf_3dB。量得 f0 = 500.00 MHz、Δf_3dB = 30.3 kHz，得 Q_L ≈ 16 500；共振時 |S11| = 0.2 且由相位判定為過耦合，β = (1 + 0.2)/(1 − 0.2) = 1.5，因此 Q0 = Q_L(1 + β) ≈ 41 300，外部品質因數 Q_ext = Q0/β ≈ 27 500。若誤判為欠耦合，β = 0.67、Q0 ≈ 27 500，差了三分之一。","textEn":"The loaded quality factor is Q_L = f0/Δf_3dB. Measuring f0 = 500.00 MHz and Δf_3dB = 30.3 kHz gives Q_L ≈ 16 500; with |S11| = 0.2 at resonance identified from its phase as over-coupled, β = (1 + 0.2)/(1 − 0.2) = 1.5, so Q0 = Q_L(1 + β) ≈ 41 300 and the external quality factor is Q_ext = Q0/β ≈ 27 500. Misreading it as under-coupled gives β = 0.67 and Q0 ≈ 27 500, one third lower.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]},{"id":"a458-v12-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「冷測：Q 值、β 與珠拉場分布量測」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Cold test: Q, β and bead-pull field mapping\", which statement holds?","options":["有載品質因數 Q_L = f0/Δf_3dB。","只要速調管輸出功率夠大，腔體場的穩定度自然就夠好。","間隙越長，粒子在電場中停留越久，能量增益一定越大。"],"optionsEn":["The loaded quality factor is Q_L = f0/Δf_3dB.","If the klystron has enough output power, cavity field stability takes care of itself.","A longer gap always gives more energy gain because the particle spends longer in the field."],"answer":0,"explanation":"有載品質因數 Q_L = f0/Δf_3dB。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"The loaded quality factor is Q_L = f0/Δf_3dB. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"a458-v12-19","title":"冷測：Q 值、β 與珠拉場分布量測：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Cold test: Q, β and bead-pull field mapping: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"],"prerequisiteIds":["a458-v12-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「網路分析儀與珠拉台」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Network analyser and bead-pull bench” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"先以校正件做網路分析儀的完整雙埠校正並把參考面移到耦合器法蘭；珠拉時以已知尺寸的金屬珠在柱形校正腔中量出形狀因子，再量待測腔，並重複拉珠三次確認頻率位移的重現性與室溫漂移扣除後的殘差小於 1%。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Perform a full two-port calibration of the network analyser with standards and move the reference plane to the coupler flange; for bead pulls, determine the bead form factor with a known metal bead in a pillbox reference cavity before measuring the cavity under test, repeat each pull three times and confirm that the frequency-shift residual after subtracting room-temperature drift is below 1%. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：未補償量測期間的室溫漂移，數 kHz 的頻率漂移會被誤讀為珠子造成的位移，得到虛假的場不平坦，進而錯誤地修調各腔；若把過耦合誤判為欠耦合，算出的 Q0 會偏差數十個百分比，進而錯估銅損與冷卻需求。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Uncompensated room-temperature drift during the measurement makes a few kHz of frequency drift look like bead-induced shift, producing a false field tilt and wrong cell tuning; mistaking over-coupling for under-coupling skews the derived Q0 by tens of percent and with it the predicted copper loss and cooling demand.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a458-v12-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"先以校正件做網路分析儀的完整雙埠校正並把參考面移到耦合器法蘭；珠拉時以已知尺寸的金屬珠在柱形校正腔中量出形狀因子，再量待測腔，並重複拉珠三次確認頻率位移的重現性與室溫漂移扣除後的殘差小於 1%。","textEn":"Perform a full two-port calibration of the network analyser with standards and move the reference plane to the coupler flange; for bead pulls, determine the bead form factor with a known metal bead in a pillbox reference cavity before measuring the cavity under test, repeat each pull three times and confirm that the frequency-shift residual after subtracting room-temperature drift is below 1%.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]},{"id":"a458-v12-19-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「冷測：Q 值、β 與珠拉場分布量測」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Cold test: Q, β and bead-pull field mapping\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","先以校正件做網路分析儀的完整雙埠校正並把參考面移到耦合器法蘭。","R/Q 越高代表腔壁材料越好、損耗越低。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","Perform a full two-port calibration of the network analyser with standards and move the reference plane to the coupler flange.","A higher R/Q means better wall material and lower loss."],"answer":1,"explanation":"先以校正件做網路分析儀的完整雙埠校正並把參考面移到耦合器法蘭；珠拉時以已知尺寸的金屬珠在柱形校正腔中量出形狀因子，再量待測腔，並重複拉珠三次確認頻率位移的重現性與室溫漂移扣除後的殘差小於 1%。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Perform a full two-port calibration of the network analyser with standards and move the reference plane to the coupler flange; for bead pulls, determine the bead form factor with a known metal bead in a pillbox reference cavity before measuring the cavity under test, repeat each pull three times and confirm that the frequency-shift residual after subtracting room-temperature drift is below 1%. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"a458-v12-20","title":"冷測：Q 值、β 與珠拉場分布量測：失效診斷","titleEn":"Cold test: Q, β and bead-pull field mapping: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"],"prerequisiteIds":["a458-v12-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「網路分析儀與珠拉台」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Network analyser and bead-pull bench” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"未補償量測期間的室溫漂移，數 kHz 的頻率漂移會被誤讀為珠子造成的位移，得到虛假的場不平坦，進而錯誤地修調各腔；若把過耦合誤判為欠耦合，算出的 Q0 會偏差數十個百分比，進而錯估銅損與冷卻需求。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Uncompensated room-temperature drift during the measurement makes a few kHz of frequency drift look like bead-induced shift, producing a false field tilt and wrong cell tuning; mistaking over-coupling for under-coupling skews the derived Q0 by tens of percent and with it the predicted copper loss and cooling demand. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：場分布以珠拉法量測：把小金屬或介電珠沿軸拉過腔體，依 Slater 微擾理論，珠子所在處的電場平方正比於共振頻率位移，由此重建 Ez(z) 並計算 R/Q 與多腔結構的場平坦度。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The field profile is mapped by the bead-pull method: a small metal or dielectric bead is drawn along the axis and, by Slater perturbation theory, the square of the electric field at the bead is proportional to the resonant-frequency shift, from which Ez(z), R/Q and the field flatness of multi-cell structures are reconstructed.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「網路分析儀上看到的頻寬直接就是腔體的 Q0。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"The bandwidth seen on the network analyser directly gives the cavity Q0.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a458-v12-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"未補償量測期間的室溫漂移，數 kHz 的頻率漂移會被誤讀為珠子造成的位移，得到虛假的場不平坦，進而錯誤地修調各腔；若把過耦合誤判為欠耦合，算出的 Q0 會偏差數十個百分比，進而錯估銅損與冷卻需求。","textEn":"Uncompensated room-temperature drift during the measurement makes a few kHz of frequency drift look like bead-induced shift, producing a false field tilt and wrong cell tuning; mistaking over-coupling for under-coupling skews the derived Q0 by tens of percent and with it the predicted copper loss and cooling demand.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]},{"id":"a458-v12-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「冷測：Q 值、β 與珠拉場分布量測」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Cold test: Q, β and bead-pull field mapping\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","腔體只要在冷測時調準頻率，運轉時就不需要再調。","未補償量測期間的室溫漂移，數 kHz 的頻率漂移會被誤讀為珠子造成的位移，得到虛假的場不平坦，進而錯誤地修調各腔。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","Once tuned at cold test, a cavity needs no tuning in operation.","Uncompensated room-temperature drift during the measurement makes a few kHz of frequency drift look like bead-induced shift, producing a false field tilt and wrong cell tuning."],"answer":2,"explanation":"未補償量測期間的室溫漂移，數 kHz 的頻率漂移會被誤讀為珠子造成的位移，得到虛假的場不平坦，進而錯誤地修調各腔；若把過耦合誤判為欠耦合，算出的 Q0 會偏差數十個百分比，進而錯估銅損與冷卻需求。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Uncompensated room-temperature drift during the measurement makes a few kHz of frequency drift look like bead-induced shift, producing a false field tilt and wrong cell tuning; mistaking over-coupling for under-coupling skews the derived Q0 by tens of percent and with it the predicted copper loss and cooling demand. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"a458-v12-21","title":"加工公差、熱失諧與調諧範圍預算：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Machining tolerance, thermal detuning and the tuning-range budget: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"],"prerequisiteIds":["a458-v12-20"],"objective":"說明「柱塞調諧器與頻率預算」如何決定粒子加速器射頻腔的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Plunger tuner and frequency budget” determines the key performance of “Particle-accelerator radio-frequency cavities”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"腔體頻率對尺寸非常敏感，加工誤差、硬焊收縮、抽真空的壁面變形與運轉時的熱膨脹都會讓頻率偏離。運轉中的頻率必須維持在有載頻寬的一小部分內，否則振幅與相位會隨失諧而改變。實務上用柱塞或壁面變形式調諧器補償，調諧範圍必須涵蓋製造殘差、熱漂移與束流負載所需的刻意失諧，並保留餘量。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「柱塞調諧器與頻率預算」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Cavity frequency is very sensitive to dimensions: machining errors, brazing shrinkage, wall deflection under vacuum and thermal expansion in operation all pull it away. In operation the frequency must stay within a small fraction of the loaded bandwidth, or amplitude and phase change with detuning. In practice a plunger or wall-deformation tuner compensates, and its range must cover fabrication residuals, thermal drift and the deliberate detuning required for beam loading, with margin. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Plunger tuner and frequency budget”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：均勻尺度誤差 Δf ≈ −f·ΔR/R：f = 508.9 MHz、R = 0.2255 m，半徑誤差 10 µm 即 Δf ≈ −22.6 kHz。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: For a uniform scale error Δf ≈ −f·ΔR/R: at f = 508.9 MHz and R = 0.2255 m a 10 µm radius error gives Δf ≈ −22.6 kHz.","failure":"常見誤解：「腔體只要在冷測時調準頻率，運轉時就不需要再調。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Once tuned at cold test, a cavity needs no tuning in operation.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「柱塞調諧器與頻率預算」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Plunger tuner and frequency budget”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a458-v12-21-k1","title":"加工公差、熱失諧與調諧範圍預算","titleEn":"Machining tolerance, thermal detuning and the tuning-range budget","text":"腔體頻率對尺寸非常敏感，加工誤差、硬焊收縮、抽真空的壁面變形與運轉時的熱膨脹都會讓頻率偏離。運轉中的頻率必須維持在有載頻寬的一小部分內，否則振幅與相位會隨失諧而改變。","textEn":"Cavity frequency is very sensitive to dimensions: machining errors, brazing shrinkage, wall deflection under vacuum and thermal expansion in operation all pull it away. In operation the frequency must stay within a small fraction of the loaded bandwidth, or amplitude and phase change with detuning.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]},{"id":"a458-v12-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：腔體只要在冷測時調準頻率，運轉時就不需要再調。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Once tuned at cold test, a cavity needs no tuning in operation. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「加工公差、熱失諧與調諧範圍預算」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Machining tolerance, thermal detuning and the tuning-range budget\" is correct?","options":["腔體頻率對尺寸非常敏感，加工誤差、硬焊收縮、抽真空的壁面變形與運轉時的熱膨脹都會讓頻率偏離。","腔體只要在冷測時調準頻率，運轉時就不需要再調。","束流只是吸收能量的負載，不會改變腔體的共振條件。"],"optionsEn":["Cavity frequency is very sensitive to dimensions: machining errors, brazing shrinkage, wall deflection under vacuum and thermal expansion in operation all pull it away.","Once tuned at cold test, a cavity needs no tuning in operation.","The beam only absorbs energy and never changes the cavity's resonance condition."],"answer":0,"explanation":"腔體頻率對尺寸非常敏感，加工誤差、硬焊收縮、抽真空的壁面變形與運轉時的熱膨脹都會讓頻率偏離。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Cavity frequency is very sensitive to dimensions: machining errors, brazing shrinkage, wall deflection under vacuum and thermal expansion in operation all pull it away. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"a458-v12-22","title":"加工公差、熱失諧與調諧範圍預算：定量估算","titleEn":"Machining tolerance, thermal detuning and the tuning-range budget: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"],"prerequisiteIds":["a458-v12-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「柱塞調諧器與頻率預算」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Plunger tuner and frequency budget” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：均勻尺度誤差 Δf ≈ −f·ΔR/R：f = 508.9 MHz、R = 0.2255 m，半徑誤差 10 µm 即 Δf ≈ −22.6 kHz。銅 α = 16.5×10⁻⁶ /K，熱失諧 −f·α ≈ −8.4 kHz/K；Q_L ≈ 9740 時半頻寬 f/(2Q_L) ≈ 26 kHz，冷卻水溫變化 0.5 K 造成 4.2 kHz 失諧，tanψ = 2Q_L·Δf/f ≈ 0.16，相位偏移約 9°。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: For a uniform scale error Δf ≈ −f·ΔR/R: at f = 508.9 MHz and R = 0.2255 m a 10 µm radius error gives Δf ≈ −22.6 kHz. Copper has α = 16.5×10⁻⁶ /K, so thermal detuning is −f·α ≈ −8.4 kHz/K; with Q_L ≈ 9740 the half bandwidth f/(2Q_L) is about 26 kHz, and a 0.5 K water change detunes 4.2 kHz, giving tanψ = 2Q_L·Δf/f ≈ 0.16, a phase shift of about 9°. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：在冷測台上逐步移動調諧器並記錄頻率，得到調諧曲線與遲滯；高功率時以入射與腔體探針的相位差作為失諧誤差訊號，觀察冷卻水溫階躍時調諧器是否在數秒內把相位拉回，並確認調諧器在最大熱負載與最大束流時仍留有至少 20% 行程。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: On the cold-test bench step the tuner and log frequency to obtain the tuning curve and hysteresis; at high power use the phase between forward and cavity-probe signals as the detuning error, watch the tuner restore phase within seconds after a water-temperature step, and confirm at least 20% of travel remains at maximum heat load and beam current.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a458-v12-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"均勻尺度誤差 Δf ≈ −f·ΔR/R：f = 508.9 MHz、R = 0.2255 m，半徑誤差 10 µm 即 Δf ≈ −22.6 kHz。銅 α = 16.5×10⁻⁶ /K，熱失諧 −f·α ≈ −8.4 kHz/K；Q_L ≈ 9740 時半頻寬 f/(2Q_L) ≈ 26 kHz，冷卻水溫變化 0.5 K 造成 4.2 kHz 失諧，tanψ = 2Q_L·Δf/f ≈ 0.16，相位偏移約 9°。","textEn":"For a uniform scale error Δf ≈ −f·ΔR/R: at f = 508.9 MHz and R = 0.2255 m a 10 µm radius error gives Δf ≈ −22.6 kHz. Copper has α = 16.5×10⁻⁶ /K, so thermal detuning is −f·α ≈ −8.4 kHz/K; with Q_L ≈ 9740 the half bandwidth f/(2Q_L) is about 26 kHz, and a 0.5 K water change detunes 4.2 kHz, giving tanψ = 2Q_L·Δf/f ≈ 0.16, a phase shift of about 9°.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]},{"id":"a458-v12-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「加工公差、熱失諧與調諧範圍預算」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Machining tolerance, thermal detuning and the tuning-range budget\", which statement holds?","options":["把柱形腔做得更長，TM010 的共振頻率就會下降。","均勻尺度誤差 Δf ≈ −f·ΔR/R：f = 508.9 MHz、R = 0.2255 m，半徑誤差 10 µm 即 Δf ≈ −22.6 kHz。","R/Q 越高代表腔壁材料越好、損耗越低。"],"optionsEn":["Making a pillbox longer lowers its TM010 resonant frequency.","For a uniform scale error Δf ≈ −f·ΔR/R: at f = 508.9 MHz and R = 0.2255 m a 10 µm radius error gives Δf ≈ −22.6 kHz.","A higher R/Q means better wall material and lower loss."],"answer":1,"explanation":"均勻尺度誤差 Δf ≈ −f·ΔR/R：f = 508.9 MHz、R = 0.2255 m，半徑誤差 10 µm 即 Δf ≈ −22.6 kHz。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"For a uniform scale error Δf ≈ −f·ΔR/R: at f = 508.9 MHz and R = 0.2255 m a 10 µm radius error gives Δf ≈ −22.6 kHz. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"a458-v12-23","title":"加工公差、熱失諧與調諧範圍預算：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Machining tolerance, thermal detuning and the tuning-range budget: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"],"prerequisiteIds":["a458-v12-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「柱塞調諧器與頻率預算」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Plunger tuner and frequency budget” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"在冷測台上逐步移動調諧器並記錄頻率，得到調諧曲線與遲滯；高功率時以入射與腔體探針的相位差作為失諧誤差訊號，觀察冷卻水溫階躍時調諧器是否在數秒內把相位拉回，並確認調諧器在最大熱負載與最大束流時仍留有至少 20% 行程。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"On the cold-test bench step the tuner and log frequency to obtain the tuning curve and hysteresis; at high power use the phase between forward and cavity-probe signals as the detuning error, watch the tuner restore phase within seconds after a water-temperature step, and confirm at least 20% of travel remains at maximum heat load and beam current. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：若調諧範圍只按冷態設計，滿功率時熱失諧加上束流負載所需的失諧把調諧器推到行程終點，腔體無法鎖頻，射頻系統只能降壓或跳脫。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: If the tuning range is sized for the cold state only, thermal detuning at full power plus the detuning required by beam loading drive the tuner to its end stop, the cavity cannot be held on frequency, and the RF system must lower voltage or trip.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a458-v12-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在冷測台上逐步移動調諧器並記錄頻率，得到調諧曲線與遲滯；高功率時以入射與腔體探針的相位差作為失諧誤差訊號，觀察冷卻水溫階躍時調諧器是否在數秒內把相位拉回，並確認調諧器在最大熱負載與最大束流時仍留有至少 20% 行程。","textEn":"On the cold-test bench step the tuner and log frequency to obtain the tuning curve and hysteresis; at high power use the phase between forward and cavity-probe signals as the detuning error, watch the tuner restore phase within seconds after a water-temperature step, and confirm at least 20% of travel remains at maximum heat load and beam current.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]},{"id":"a458-v12-23-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「加工公差、熱失諧與調諧範圍預算」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Machining tolerance, thermal detuning and the tuning-range budget\"?","options":["只要模擬結果看起來合理，就可以省略實體量測與校正。","耦合係數永遠應該設在 β = 1 才是最佳匹配。","在冷測台上逐步移動調諧器並記錄頻率，得到調諧曲線與遲滯。"],"optionsEn":["If the simulation looks reasonable, physical measurement and calibration can be skipped.","The coupling factor should always be β = 1 for the best match.","On the cold-test bench step the tuner and log frequency to obtain the tuning curve and hysteresis."],"answer":2,"explanation":"在冷測台上逐步移動調諧器並記錄頻率，得到調諧曲線與遲滯；高功率時以入射與腔體探針的相位差作為失諧誤差訊號，觀察冷卻水溫階躍時調諧器是否在數秒內把相位拉回，並確認調諧器在最大熱負載與最大束流時仍留有至少 20% 行程。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"On the cold-test bench step the tuner and log frequency to obtain the tuning curve and hysteresis; at high power use the phase between forward and cavity-probe signals as the detuning error, watch the tuner restore phase within seconds after a water-temperature step, and confirm at least 20% of travel remains at maximum heat load and beam current. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"a458-v12-24","title":"加工公差、熱失諧與調諧範圍預算：失效診斷","titleEn":"Machining tolerance, thermal detuning and the tuning-range budget: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"],"prerequisiteIds":["a458-v12-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「柱塞調諧器與頻率預算」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Plunger tuner and frequency budget” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"若調諧範圍只按冷態設計，滿功率時熱失諧加上束流負載所需的失諧把調諧器推到行程終點，腔體無法鎖頻，射頻系統只能降壓或跳脫。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"If the tuning range is sized for the cold state only, thermal detuning at full power plus the detuning required by beam loading drive the tuner to its end stop, the cavity cannot be held on frequency, and the RF system must lower voltage or trip. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：實務上用柱塞或壁面變形式調諧器補償，調諧範圍必須涵蓋製造殘差、熱漂移與束流負載所需的刻意失諧，並保留餘量。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: In practice a plunger or wall-deformation tuner compensates, and its range must cover fabrication residuals, thermal drift and the deliberate detuning required for beam loading, with margin.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「腔體只要在冷測時調準頻率，運轉時就不需要再調。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Once tuned at cold test, a cavity needs no tuning in operation.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a458-v12-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若調諧範圍只按冷態設計，滿功率時熱失諧加上束流負載所需的失諧把調諧器推到行程終點，腔體無法鎖頻，射頻系統只能降壓或跳脫。","textEn":"If the tuning range is sized for the cold state only, thermal detuning at full power plus the detuning required by beam loading drive the tuner to its end stop, the cavity cannot be held on frequency, and the RF system must lower voltage or trip.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]},{"id":"a458-v12-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「加工公差、熱失諧與調諧範圍預算」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Machining tolerance, thermal detuning and the tuning-range budget\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["若調諧範圍只按冷態設計，滿功率時熱失諧加上束流負載所需的失諧把調諧器推到行程終點，腔體無法鎖頻，射頻系統只能降壓或跳脫。","只要重新開機或重設軟體，硬體失效也會一併排除。","束流只是吸收能量的負載，不會改變腔體的共振條件。"],"optionsEn":["If the tuning range is sized for the cold state only, thermal detuning at full power plus the detuning required by beam loading drive the tuner to its end stop, the cavity cannot be held on frequency, and the RF system must lower voltage or trip.","Restarting or resetting the software also clears hardware failures.","The beam only absorbs energy and never changes the cavity's resonance condition."],"answer":0,"explanation":"若調諧範圍只按冷態設計，滿功率時熱失諧加上束流負載所需的失諧把調諧器推到行程終點，腔體無法鎖頻，射頻系統只能降壓或跳脫。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"If the tuning range is sized for the cold state only, thermal detuning at full power plus the detuning required by beam loading drive the tuner to its end stop, the cavity cannot be held on frequency, and the RF system must lower voltage or trip. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"a458-v12-s4","title":"系統整合、驗證與工程交接","titleEn":"Integration, validation and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「束流負載補償與最佳耦合」與「功率源、低階射頻控制與驗收交接」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Beam-loading compensation and optimum coupling\" and \"Power source, low-level RF control and acceptance handoff\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a458-v12-25","title":"束流負載補償與最佳耦合：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Beam-loading compensation and optimum coupling: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"],"prerequisiteIds":["a458-v12-24"],"objective":"說明「束流電流與腔體失諧」如何決定粒子加速器射頻腔的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Beam current and cavity detuning” determines the key performance of “Particle-accelerator radio-frequency cavities”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"高電流束流穿過腔體時會感應出自身的場，等效上是一個與腔電壓不同相的電流源，稱為束流負載。為了讓發電機只看到純電阻負載、沒有反射，需同時把耦合係數提高到 β_opt = 1 + P_b/P_c，並把腔體刻意失諧以抵消束流電流的虛部。電流越大失諧越大，當失諧接近儲存環迴轉頻率時，加速模的阻抗會落在相鄰迴轉諧波上，引發縱向耦合束團不穩定；KEKB 的 ARES 腔以額外的大儲能腔降低有效 R/Q 來解決此問題。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「束流電流與腔體失諧」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A high-current beam passing through the cavity induces its own field, equivalent to a current source out of phase with the cavity voltage, which is called beam loading. To present the generator with a purely resistive load and no reflection, the coupling is raised to β_opt = 1 + P_b/P_c and the cavity is deliberately detuned to cancel the reactive part of the beam current. The detuning grows with current, and when it approaches the ring revolution frequency the accelerating-mode impedance lands on neighbouring revolution harmonics and drives longitudinal coupled-bunch instability; the ARES cavity at KEKB attached a large storage cavity to lower the effective R/Q and solve this. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Beam current and cavity detuning”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：設 V = 0.6 MV、R_sh = 5.0 MΩ、P_c = 72 kW，束流 I0 = 0.4 A、每腔能損 0.25 MV，P_b = 100 kW，β_opt = 2.39，Q_L = 3.3×10⁴/3.39 ≈ 9740；cosφs = 0.25/0.6，sinφs ≈ 0.909，tanψ = I0·R_sh·sinφs/((1+β)V) ≈ 0.894，失諧 Δf = tanψ·f/(2Q_L) ≈ 23 kHz（低於共振方向），發電機功率 P_g = P_c + P_b = 172 kW。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Take V = 0.6 MV, R_sh = 5.0 MΩ and P_c = 72 kW, with I0 = 0.4 A and 0.25 MV energy loss per cavity, so P_b = 100 kW, β_opt = 2.39 and Q_L = 3.3×10⁴/3.39 ≈ 9740; cosφs = 0.25/0.6 and sinφs ≈ 0.909 give tanψ = I0·R_sh·sinφs/((1+β)V) ≈ 0.894 and a detuning Δf = tanψ·f/(2Q_L) ≈ 23 kHz below resonance, with generator power P_g = P_c + P_b = 172 kW.","failure":"常見誤解：「束流只是吸收能量的負載，不會改變腔體的共振條件。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"The beam only absorbs energy and never changes the cavity's resonance condition.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「束流電流與腔體失諧」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Beam current and cavity detuning”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a458-v12-25-k1","title":"束流負載補償與最佳耦合","titleEn":"Beam-loading compensation and optimum coupling","text":"高電流束流穿過腔體時會感應出自身的場，等效上是一個與腔電壓不同相的電流源，稱為束流負載。為了讓發電機只看到純電阻負載、沒有反射，需同時把耦合係數提高到 β_opt = 1 + P_b/P_c，並把腔體刻意失諧以抵消束流電流的虛部。","textEn":"A high-current beam passing through the cavity induces its own field, equivalent to a current source out of phase with the cavity voltage, which is called beam loading. To present the generator with a purely resistive load and no reflection, the coupling is raised to β_opt = 1 + P_b/P_c and the cavity is deliberately detuned to cancel the reactive part of the beam current.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]},{"id":"a458-v12-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：束流只是吸收能量的負載，不會改變腔體的共振條件。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: The beam only absorbs energy and never changes the cavity's resonance condition. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「束流負載補償與最佳耦合」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Beam-loading compensation and optimum coupling\" is correct?","options":["束流只是吸收能量的負載，不會改變腔體的共振條件。","高電流束流穿過腔體時會感應出自身的場，等效上是一個與腔電壓不同相的電流源，稱為束流負載。","只要速調管輸出功率夠大，腔體場的穩定度自然就夠好。"],"optionsEn":["The beam only absorbs energy and never changes the cavity's resonance condition.","A high-current beam passing through the cavity induces its own field, equivalent to a current source out of phase with the cavity voltage, which is called beam loading.","If the klystron has enough output power, cavity field stability takes care of itself."],"answer":1,"explanation":"高電流束流穿過腔體時會感應出自身的場，等效上是一個與腔電壓不同相的電流源，稱為束流負載。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A high-current beam passing through the cavity induces its own field, equivalent to a current source out of phase with the cavity voltage, which is called beam loading. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"a458-v12-26","title":"束流負載補償與最佳耦合：定量估算","titleEn":"Beam-loading compensation and optimum coupling: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"],"prerequisiteIds":["a458-v12-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「束流電流與腔體失諧」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Beam current and cavity detuning” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：設 V = 0.6 MV、R_sh = 5.0 MΩ、P_c = 72 kW，束流 I0 = 0.4 A、每腔能損 0.25 MV，P_b = 100 kW，β_opt = 2.39，Q_L = 3.3×10⁴/3.39 ≈ 9740；cosφs = 0.25/0.6，sinφs ≈ 0.909，tanψ = I0·R_sh·sinφs/((1+β)V) ≈ 0.894，失諧 Δf = tanψ·f/(2Q_L) ≈ 23 kHz（低於共振方向），發電機功率 P_g = P_c + P_b = 172 kW。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Take V = 0.6 MV, R_sh = 5.0 MΩ and P_c = 72 kW, with I0 = 0.4 A and 0.25 MV energy loss per cavity, so P_b = 100 kW, β_opt = 2.39 and Q_L = 3.3×10⁴/3.39 ≈ 9740; cosφs = 0.25/0.6 and sinφs ≈ 0.909 give tanψ = I0·R_sh·sinφs/((1+β)V) ≈ 0.894 and a detuning Δf = tanψ·f/(2Q_L) ≈ 23 kHz below resonance, with generator power P_g = P_c + P_b = 172 kW. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：逐步增加儲存電流，記錄入射、反射功率、調諧器位置與腔體相位，與上式預測的失諧對電流曲線比較；以束流頻譜或縱向束團位置監測器觀察同步振盪邊帶，確認沒有在迴轉諧波上出現成長中的耦合束團模態。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Raise the stored current in steps while logging forward and reflected power, tuner position and cavity phase, and compare with the predicted detuning-versus-current curve; watch synchrotron sidebands on the beam spectrum or a longitudinal bunch-position monitor to confirm that no growing coupled-bunch mode appears at the revolution harmonics.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a458-v12-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"設 V = 0.6 MV、R_sh = 5.0 MΩ、P_c = 72 kW，束流 I0 = 0.4 A、每腔能損 0.25 MV，P_b = 100 kW，β_opt = 2.39，Q_L = 3.3×10⁴/3.39 ≈ 9740；cosφs = 0.25/0.6，sinφs ≈ 0.909，tanψ = I0·R_sh·sinφs/((1+β)V) ≈ 0.894，失諧 Δf = tanψ·f/(2Q_L) ≈ 23 kHz（低於共振方向），發電機功率 P_g = P_c + P_b = 172 kW。","textEn":"Take V = 0.6 MV, R_sh = 5.0 MΩ and P_c = 72 kW, with I0 = 0.4 A and 0.25 MV energy loss per cavity, so P_b = 100 kW, β_opt = 2.39 and Q_L = 3.3×10⁴/3.39 ≈ 9740; cosφs = 0.25/0.6 and sinφs ≈ 0.909 give tanψ = I0·R_sh·sinφs/((1+β)V) ≈ 0.894 and a detuning Δf = tanψ·f/(2Q_L) ≈ 23 kHz below resonance, with generator power P_g = P_c + P_b = 172 kW.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]},{"id":"a458-v12-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「束流負載補償與最佳耦合」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Beam-loading compensation and optimum coupling\", which statement holds?","options":["間隙越長，粒子在電場中停留越久，能量增益一定越大。","耦合係數永遠應該設在 β = 1 才是最佳匹配。","設 V = 0.6 MV、R_sh = 5.0 MΩ、P_c = 72 kW，束流 I0 = 0.4 A、每腔能損 0.25 MV，P_b = 100 kW，β_opt = 2.39，Q_L = 3.3×10⁴/3.39 ≈ 9740。"],"optionsEn":["A longer gap always gives more energy gain because the particle spends longer in the field.","The coupling factor should always be β = 1 for the best match.","Take V = 0.6 MV, R_sh = 5.0 MΩ and P_c = 72 kW, with I0 = 0.4 A and 0.25 MV energy loss per cavity, so P_b = 100 kW, β_opt = 2.39 and Q_L = 3.3×10⁴/3.39 ≈ 9740."],"answer":2,"explanation":"設 V = 0.6 MV、R_sh = 5.0 MΩ、P_c = 72 kW，束流 I0 = 0.4 A、每腔能損 0.25 MV，P_b = 100 kW，β_opt = 2.39，Q_L = 3.3×10⁴/3.39 ≈ 9740；cosφs = 0.25/0.6，sinφs ≈ 0.909，tanψ = I0·R_sh·sinφs/((1+β)V) ≈ 0.894，失諧 Δf = tanψ·f/(2Q_L) ≈ 23 kHz（低於共振方向），發電機功率 P_g = P_c + P_b = 172 kW。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Take V = 0.6 MV, R_sh = 5.0 MΩ and P_c = 72 kW, with I0 = 0.4 A and 0.25 MV energy loss per cavity, so P_b = 100 kW, β_opt = 2.39 and Q_L = 3.3×10⁴/3.39 ≈ 9740; cosφs = 0.25/0.6 and sinφs ≈ 0.909 give tanψ = I0·R_sh·sinφs/((1+β)V) ≈ 0.894 and a detuning Δf = tanψ·f/(2Q_L) ≈ 23 kHz below resonance, with generator power P_g = P_c + P_b = 172 kW. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"a458-v12-27","title":"束流負載補償與最佳耦合：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Beam-loading compensation and optimum coupling: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"],"prerequisiteIds":["a458-v12-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「束流電流與腔體失諧」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Beam current and cavity detuning” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"逐步增加儲存電流，記錄入射、反射功率、調諧器位置與腔體相位，與上式預測的失諧對電流曲線比較；以束流頻譜或縱向束團位置監測器觀察同步振盪邊帶，確認沒有在迴轉諧波上出現成長中的耦合束團模態。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Raise the stored current in steps while logging forward and reflected power, tuner position and cavity phase, and compare with the predicted detuning-versus-current curve; watch synchrotron sidebands on the beam spectrum or a longitudinal bunch-position monitor to confirm that no growing coupled-bunch mode appears at the revolution harmonics. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：失諧方向設錯或束流電流超過 Robinson 穩定極限時，同步振盪振幅會快速成長，束流在數毫秒內丟失；β 固定在低電流值時，滿載下反射功率大增，環形器負載過熱跳機。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: With the wrong detuning sign or a current beyond the Robinson stability limit, synchrotron oscillations grow quickly and the beam is lost within milliseconds; with β fixed at a low-current value, reflected power at full current overheats the circulator load and trips the system.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a458-v12-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"逐步增加儲存電流，記錄入射、反射功率、調諧器位置與腔體相位，與上式預測的失諧對電流曲線比較；以束流頻譜或縱向束團位置監測器觀察同步振盪邊帶，確認沒有在迴轉諧波上出現成長中的耦合束團模態。","textEn":"Raise the stored current in steps while logging forward and reflected power, tuner position and cavity phase, and compare with the predicted detuning-versus-current curve; watch synchrotron sidebands on the beam spectrum or a longitudinal bunch-position monitor to confirm that no growing coupled-bunch mode appears at the revolution harmonics.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]},{"id":"a458-v12-27-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「束流負載補償與最佳耦合」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Beam-loading compensation and optimum coupling\"?","options":["逐步增加儲存電流，記錄入射、反射功率、調諧器位置與腔體相位，與上式預測的失諧對電流曲線比較。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","網路分析儀上看到的頻寬直接就是腔體的 Q0。"],"optionsEn":["Raise the stored current in steps while logging forward and reflected power, tuner position and cavity phase, and compare with the predicted detuning-versus-current curve.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","The bandwidth seen on the network analyser directly gives the cavity Q0."],"answer":0,"explanation":"逐步增加儲存電流，記錄入射、反射功率、調諧器位置與腔體相位，與上式預測的失諧對電流曲線比較；以束流頻譜或縱向束團位置監測器觀察同步振盪邊帶，確認沒有在迴轉諧波上出現成長中的耦合束團模態。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Raise the stored current in steps while logging forward and reflected power, tuner position and cavity phase, and compare with the predicted detuning-versus-current curve; watch synchrotron sidebands on the beam spectrum or a longitudinal bunch-position monitor to confirm that no growing coupled-bunch mode appears at the revolution harmonics. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"a458-v12-28","title":"束流負載補償與最佳耦合：失效診斷","titleEn":"Beam-loading compensation and optimum coupling: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"],"prerequisiteIds":["a458-v12-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「束流電流與腔體失諧」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Beam current and cavity detuning” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"失諧方向設錯或束流電流超過 Robinson 穩定極限時，同步振盪振幅會快速成長，束流在數毫秒內丟失；β 固定在低電流值時，滿載下反射功率大增，環形器負載過熱跳機。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"With the wrong detuning sign or a current beyond the Robinson stability limit, synchrotron oscillations grow quickly and the beam is lost within milliseconds; with β fixed at a low-current value, reflected power at full current overheats the circulator load and trips the system. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：電流越大失諧越大，當失諧接近儲存環迴轉頻率時，加速模的阻抗會落在相鄰迴轉諧波上，引發縱向耦合束團不穩定；KEKB 的 ARES 腔以額外的大儲能腔降低有效 R/Q 來解決此問題。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The detuning grows with current, and when it approaches the ring revolution frequency the accelerating-mode impedance lands on neighbouring revolution harmonics and drives longitudinal coupled-bunch instability; the ARES cavity at KEKB attached a large storage cavity to lower the effective R/Q and solve this.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「束流只是吸收能量的負載，不會改變腔體的共振條件。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"The beam only absorbs energy and never changes the cavity's resonance condition.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a458-v12-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"失諧方向設錯或束流電流超過 Robinson 穩定極限時，同步振盪振幅會快速成長，束流在數毫秒內丟失；β 固定在低電流值時，滿載下反射功率大增，環形器負載過熱跳機。","textEn":"With the wrong detuning sign or a current beyond the Robinson stability limit, synchrotron oscillations grow quickly and the beam is lost within milliseconds; with β fixed at a low-current value, reflected power at full current overheats the circulator load and trips the system.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]},{"id":"a458-v12-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「束流負載補償與最佳耦合」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Beam-loading compensation and optimum coupling\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","失諧方向設錯或束流電流超過 Robinson 穩定極限時，同步振盪振幅會快速成長，束流在數毫秒內丟失。","只要速調管輸出功率夠大，腔體場的穩定度自然就夠好。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","With the wrong detuning sign or a current beyond the Robinson stability limit, synchrotron oscillations grow quickly and the beam is lost within milliseconds.","If the klystron has enough output power, cavity field stability takes care of itself."],"answer":1,"explanation":"失諧方向設錯或束流電流超過 Robinson 穩定極限時，同步振盪振幅會快速成長，束流在數毫秒內丟失；β 固定在低電流值時，滿載下反射功率大增，環形器負載過熱跳機。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"With the wrong detuning sign or a current beyond the Robinson stability limit, synchrotron oscillations grow quickly and the beam is lost within milliseconds; with β fixed at a low-current value, reflected power at full current overheats the circulator load and trips the system. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"a458-v12-29","title":"功率源、低階射頻控制與驗收交接：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Power source, low-level RF control and acceptance handoff: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"],"prerequisiteIds":["a458-v12-28"],"objective":"說明「速調管、固態放大器與 LLRF」如何決定粒子加速器射頻腔的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Klystron, solid-state amplifier and LLRF” determines the key performance of “Particle-accelerator radio-frequency cavities”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"射頻功率由速調管或模組化固態放大器提供，經波導、環形器與耦合器送入腔體；速調管單管可達百萬瓦但有高壓電源與陰極壽命問題，固態放大器以數百個電晶體模組合成，單模組失效只降低少量功率。低階射頻系統以數位 IQ 解調取樣腔體探針訊號，透過比例積分回授與前饋把振幅與相位鎖在設定值，並控制調諧器。驗收要同時證明場穩定度、跳機率、聯鎖反應與老練紀錄，而不只是達到額定電壓。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「速調管、固態放大器與 LLRF」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"RF power comes from a klystron or a modular solid-state amplifier and flows through waveguide, circulator and coupler into the cavity; a single klystron reaches megawatts but brings a high-voltage modulator and cathode lifetime issues, while a solid-state amplifier combines hundreds of transistor modules so one module failure costs only a little power. The low-level RF system samples the cavity probe with digital IQ demodulation, locks amplitude and phase to setpoints with proportional-integral feedback and feed-forward, and drives the tuner. Acceptance must demonstrate field stability, trip rate, interlock response and conditioning history together, not merely rated voltage. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Klystron, solid-state amplifier and LLRF”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：能量增益 E = V·cosφ 的相對誤差 δE/E = √[(δV/V)² + (tanφ·δφ)²]。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: The relative error of energy gain E = V·cosφ is δE/E = √[(δV/V)² + (tanφ·δφ)²].","failure":"常見誤解：「只要速調管輸出功率夠大，腔體場的穩定度自然就夠好。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"If the klystron has enough output power, cavity field stability takes care of itself.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「速調管、固態放大器與 LLRF」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Klystron, solid-state amplifier and LLRF”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a458-v12-29-k1","title":"功率源、低階射頻控制與驗收交接","titleEn":"Power source, low-level RF control and acceptance handoff","text":"射頻功率由速調管或模組化固態放大器提供，經波導、環形器與耦合器送入腔體；速調管單管可達百萬瓦但有高壓電源與陰極壽命問題，固態放大器以數百個電晶體模組合成，單模組失效只降低少量功率。低階射頻系統以數位 IQ 解調取樣腔體探針訊號，透過比例積分回授與前饋把振幅與相位鎖在設定值，並控制調諧器。","textEn":"RF power comes from a klystron or a modular solid-state amplifier and flows through waveguide, circulator and coupler into the cavity; a single klystron reaches megawatts but brings a high-voltage modulator and cathode lifetime issues, while a solid-state amplifier combines hundreds of transistor modules so one module failure costs only a little power. The low-level RF system samples the cavity probe with digital IQ demodulation, locks amplitude and phase to setpoints with proportional-integral feedback and feed-forward, and drives the tuner.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]},{"id":"a458-v12-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要速調管輸出功率夠大，腔體場的穩定度自然就夠好。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: If the klystron has enough output power, cavity field stability takes care of itself. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「功率源、低階射頻控制與驗收交接」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Power source, low-level RF control and acceptance handoff\" is correct?","options":["只要速調管輸出功率夠大，腔體場的穩定度自然就夠好。","把柱形腔做得更長，TM010 的共振頻率就會下降。","射頻功率由速調管或模組化固態放大器提供，經波導、環形器與耦合器送入腔體。"],"optionsEn":["If the klystron has enough output power, cavity field stability takes care of itself.","Making a pillbox longer lowers its TM010 resonant frequency.","RF power comes from a klystron or a modular solid-state amplifier and flows through waveguide, circulator and coupler into the cavity."],"answer":2,"explanation":"射頻功率由速調管或模組化固態放大器提供，經波導、環形器與耦合器送入腔體；速調管單管可達百萬瓦但有高壓電源與陰極壽命問題，固態放大器以數百個電晶體模組合成，單模組失效只降低少量功率。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"RF power comes from a klystron or a modular solid-state amplifier and flows through waveguide, circulator and coupler into the cavity; a single klystron reaches megawatts but brings a high-voltage modulator and cathode lifetime issues, while a solid-state amplifier combines hundreds of transistor modules so one module failure costs only a little power. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"a458-v12-30","title":"功率源、低階射頻控制與驗收交接：定量估算","titleEn":"Power source, low-level RF control and acceptance handoff: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"],"prerequisiteIds":["a458-v12-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「速調管、固態放大器與 LLRF」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Klystron, solid-state amplifier and LLRF” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：能量增益 E = V·cosφ 的相對誤差 δE/E = √[(δV/V)² + (tanφ·δφ)²]。離峰 φ = 20°、振幅抖動 0.1%、相位抖動 0.1° = 1.745 mrad 時，tanφ·δφ ≈ 0.364×1.745×10⁻³ ≈ 6.4×10⁻⁴，總和 ≈ 1.18×10⁻³。迴路增益 G = 50 可把功率源 1% 漣波壓到約 1%/(1+G) ≈ 0.02%。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: The relative error of energy gain E = V·cosφ is δE/E = √[(δV/V)² + (tanφ·δφ)²]. Off crest at φ = 20° with 0.1% amplitude jitter and 0.1° = 1.745 mrad phase jitter, tanφ·δφ ≈ 0.364×1.745×10⁻³ ≈ 6.4×10⁻⁴ and the total is ≈ 1.18×10⁻³. A loop gain G = 50 suppresses a 1% source ripple to about 1%/(1+G) ≈ 0.02%. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以獨立的低相位雜訊參考與 IQ 量測鏈記錄閉迴路下振幅與相位的頻譜，積分到束流敏感的頻帶後與規格比較；以注入步階與調變檢查迴路頻寬、相位餘裕與延遲；最後在滿電流下連續運轉數十小時統計跳機次數與原因，連同老練曲線、聯鎖測試與冷測數據一起寫入交接文件。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Record closed-loop amplitude and phase spectra with an independent low-phase-noise reference and IQ measurement chain, integrate over the band the beam is sensitive to and compare with specification; check loop bandwidth, phase margin and delay with injected steps and modulation; finally run tens of hours at full current, tally trips by cause, and file them with conditioning curves, interlock tests and cold-test data in the handoff record.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a458-v12-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"能量增益 E = V·cosφ 的相對誤差 δE/E = √[(δV/V)² + (tanφ·δφ)²]。離峰 φ = 20°、振幅抖動 0.1%、相位抖動 0.1° = 1.745 mrad 時，tanφ·δφ ≈ 0.364×1.745×10⁻³ ≈ 6.4×10⁻⁴，總和 ≈ 1.18×10⁻³。迴路增益 G = 50 可把功率源 1% 漣波壓到約 1%/(1+G) ≈ 0.02%。","textEn":"The relative error of energy gain E = V·cosφ is δE/E = √[(δV/V)² + (tanφ·δφ)²]. Off crest at φ = 20° with 0.1% amplitude jitter and 0.1° = 1.745 mrad phase jitter, tanφ·δφ ≈ 0.364×1.745×10⁻³ ≈ 6.4×10⁻⁴ and the total is ≈ 1.18×10⁻³. A loop gain G = 50 suppresses a 1% source ripple to about 1%/(1+G) ≈ 0.02%.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]},{"id":"a458-v12-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「功率源、低階射頻控制與驗收交接」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Power source, low-level RF control and acceptance handoff\", which statement holds?","options":["能量增益 E = V·cosφ 的相對誤差 δE/E = √[(δV/V)² + (tanφ·δφ)²]。","R/Q 越高代表腔壁材料越好、損耗越低。","網路分析儀上看到的頻寬直接就是腔體的 Q0。"],"optionsEn":["The relative error of energy gain E = V·cosφ is δE/E = √[(δV/V)² + (tanφ·δφ)²].","A higher R/Q means better wall material and lower loss.","The bandwidth seen on the network analyser directly gives the cavity Q0."],"answer":0,"explanation":"能量增益 E = V·cosφ 的相對誤差 δE/E = √[(δV/V)² + (tanφ·δφ)²]。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"The relative error of energy gain E = V·cosφ is δE/E = √[(δV/V)² + (tanφ·δφ)²]. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"a458-v12-31","title":"功率源、低階射頻控制與驗收交接：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Power source, low-level RF control and acceptance handoff: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"],"prerequisiteIds":["a458-v12-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「速調管、固態放大器與 LLRF」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Klystron, solid-state amplifier and LLRF” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以獨立的低相位雜訊參考與 IQ 量測鏈記錄閉迴路下振幅與相位的頻譜，積分到束流敏感的頻帶後與規格比較；以注入步階與調變檢查迴路頻寬、相位餘裕與延遲；最後在滿電流下連續運轉數十小時統計跳機次數與原因，連同老練曲線、聯鎖測試與冷測數據一起寫入交接文件。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Record closed-loop amplitude and phase spectra with an independent low-phase-noise reference and IQ measurement chain, integrate over the band the beam is sensitive to and compare with specification; check loop bandwidth, phase margin and delay with injected steps and modulation; finally run tens of hours at full current, tally trips by cause, and file them with conditioning curves, interlock tests and cold-test data in the handoff record. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：迴路延遲過長卻把增益調得過高，回授在數百 kHz 處振盪，腔體場出現邊帶並調變束流；速調管工作在飽和區時沒有控制餘量，電源漣波直接傳到加速相位，表現為光束線光源點的時序與能量抖動。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Too much gain with too much loop delay makes the feedback oscillate at a few hundred kHz, putting sidebands on the cavity field that modulate the beam; a klystron driven into saturation leaves no control headroom, so modulator ripple passes straight into the accelerating phase and shows up as timing and energy jitter at the beamline source point.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a458-v12-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以獨立的低相位雜訊參考與 IQ 量測鏈記錄閉迴路下振幅與相位的頻譜，積分到束流敏感的頻帶後與規格比較；以注入步階與調變檢查迴路頻寬、相位餘裕與延遲；最後在滿電流下連續運轉數十小時統計跳機次數與原因，連同老練曲線、聯鎖測試與冷測數據一起寫入交接文件。","textEn":"Record closed-loop amplitude and phase spectra with an independent low-phase-noise reference and IQ measurement chain, integrate over the band the beam is sensitive to and compare with specification; check loop bandwidth, phase margin and delay with injected steps and modulation; finally run tens of hours at full current, tally trips by cause, and file them with conditioning curves, interlock tests and cold-test data in the handoff record.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]},{"id":"a458-v12-31-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「功率源、低階射頻控制與驗收交接」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Power source, low-level RF control and acceptance handoff\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","以獨立的低相位雜訊參考與 IQ 量測鏈記錄閉迴路下振幅與相位的頻譜，積分到束流敏感的頻帶後與規格比較。","腔體只要在冷測時調準頻率，運轉時就不需要再調。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Record closed-loop amplitude and phase spectra with an independent low-phase-noise reference and IQ measurement chain, integrate over the band the beam is sensitive to and compare with specification.","Once tuned at cold test, a cavity needs no tuning in operation."],"answer":1,"explanation":"以獨立的低相位雜訊參考與 IQ 量測鏈記錄閉迴路下振幅與相位的頻譜，積分到束流敏感的頻帶後與規格比較；以注入步階與調變檢查迴路頻寬、相位餘裕與延遲；最後在滿電流下連續運轉數十小時統計跳機次數與原因，連同老練曲線、聯鎖測試與冷測數據一起寫入交接文件。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Record closed-loop amplitude and phase spectra with an independent low-phase-noise reference and IQ measurement chain, integrate over the band the beam is sensitive to and compare with specification; check loop bandwidth, phase margin and delay with injected steps and modulation; finally run tens of hours at full current, tally trips by cause, and file them with conditioning curves, interlock tests and cold-test data in the handoff record. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"a458-v12-32","title":"功率源、低階射頻控制與驗收交接：失效診斷","titleEn":"Power source, low-level RF control and acceptance handoff: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"],"prerequisiteIds":["a458-v12-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「速調管、固態放大器與 LLRF」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Klystron, solid-state amplifier and LLRF” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"迴路延遲過長卻把增益調得過高，回授在數百 kHz 處振盪，腔體場出現邊帶並調變束流；速調管工作在飽和區時沒有控制餘量，電源漣波直接傳到加速相位，表現為光束線光源點的時序與能量抖動。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Too much gain with too much loop delay makes the feedback oscillate at a few hundred kHz, putting sidebands on the cavity field that modulate the beam; a klystron driven into saturation leaves no control headroom, so modulator ripple passes straight into the accelerating phase and shows up as timing and energy jitter at the beamline source point. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：驗收要同時證明場穩定度、跳機率、聯鎖反應與老練紀錄，而不只是達到額定電壓。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Acceptance must demonstrate field stability, trip rate, interlock response and conditioning history together, not merely rated voltage.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要速調管輸出功率夠大，腔體場的穩定度自然就夠好。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"If the klystron has enough output power, cavity field stability takes care of itself.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a458-v12-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"迴路延遲過長卻把增益調得過高，回授在數百 kHz 處振盪，腔體場出現邊帶並調變束流；速調管工作在飽和區時沒有控制餘量，電源漣波直接傳到加速相位，表現為光束線光源點的時序與能量抖動。","textEn":"Too much gain with too much loop delay makes the feedback oscillate at a few hundred kHz, putting sidebands on the cavity field that modulate the beam; a klystron driven into saturation leaves no control headroom, so modulator ripple passes straight into the accelerating phase and shows up as timing and energy jitter at the beamline source point.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]},{"id":"a458-v12-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「功率源、低階射頻控制與驗收交接」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Power source, low-level RF control and acceptance handoff\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","把柱形腔做得更長，TM010 的共振頻率就會下降。","迴路延遲過長卻把增益調得過高，回授在數百 kHz 處振盪，腔體場出現邊帶並調變束流。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","Making a pillbox longer lowers its TM010 resonant frequency.","Too much gain with too much loop delay makes the feedback oscillate at a few hundred kHz, putting sidebands on the cavity field that modulate the beam."],"answer":2,"explanation":"迴路延遲過長卻把增益調得過高，回授在數百 kHz 處振盪，腔體場出現邊帶並調變束流；速調管工作在飽和區時沒有控制餘量，電源漣波直接傳到加速相位，表現為光束線光源點的時序與能量抖動。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Too much gain with too much loop delay makes the feedback oscillate at a few hundred kHz, putting sidebands on the cavity field that modulate the beam; a klystron driven into saturation leaves no control headroom, so modulator ripple passes straight into the accelerating phase and shows up as timing and energy jitter at the beamline source point. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4}],"sourceIds":["v12o-cern-rf-cavities","v12o-cas-jensen-rf-cavity-design","v12o-kekb-design-report-rf","v12o-cas-rf-for-accelerators-2010"],"curriculumVersion":12,"stepCount":32,"estimatedMinutes":800}};
